  <book code="JHN" style="id">EN_DADT mji-x-daoaodai_Dao⋅Ao⋅Dai_ltr Tue Nov 18 2025 16:55:35 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yô-hanx Cuđ Jenx</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yô-hanx</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jhn</para>
  <para style="mt">Yô-hanx</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Quef coonz naih Gâyf, Gâyf cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh yămz, Gâyf six Zâu Tênb-Huungh. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Tăng quef coonz Nănh cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh yămz. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Muif huungđ păngc Nănh tuz zuyx taih, năngđ coong max păngc Nănh zuyx taih, six max naih laiv huungđ tuz setb taih. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Nănh six săngh mengc, nzof săngh mengc six bamh munh nyăngz gwăngz. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Gwăngz siux nzac nzămc, nzof nzămc yâuc max hayh hingh tuz gwăngz.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Naih ah lanh munh tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh paiđ taih, nănh nyăngz bux six hipđ ayx Yô-hanx. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Nănh taih six nongc ayx zanyx manyf, nănh six ayx zanyx manyf phunz gwăngz, ayx phunz tăng nănh, muif lanh munh nzăngđ hayh zen. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Nănh six max zâyf senz gwăngz, six nănh taih nongc ayx zanyx manyf phunz gwăngz. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Nây gwăngz six senz nyăngz gwăngz, nzac bamh canz taih, nongc siux gwăngz phunz muif lanh munh. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Nănh yămz nây bamh canz nzof, wâyc păngc Nănh bamh canz tuz zuyx taih, six bamh munh yâuc max saz tuz Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Nănh taih tauv Nănh nyăngz tinc, six Nănh nyăngz munh yâuc max stipx Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Six tinyh phanv laiv lanh stipx Nănh, yâuc zen Nănh nyăngz manyh wax đomc munh, Nănh six sađ lanyf phunz stiz tuz săngh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz toonz sab. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Wax đomc munh tuz steengb max zâyf tăng samđ stâyz, lauf max zâyf tăng bamh munh nyăngz stinb a, max six tăng bamh munh nyăngz zux ix, six tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Gâyf săngh ah tauh bamh munh, yâuc yămz pănh nyăngz mungh tongx, naih pôz cloon senz gâyf pong nzuf, pănh tuz phătc Nănh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, six senz Ah Lanh Đokc Toonz tăng Tênb-toongh Pha taih nyăngz gwăngz eeng. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yô-hanx ayx zanyx manyf phunz Nănh yâuc hamv lub coong: “Nây six yaz coong tauv wax Tauh gôh: ‘Taih đangz yaz wax Tauh six năngx lub têx yaz, wâyc Nănh yămz đangc yaz nzof.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Wâyc Nănh naih dloih muif huungđ pôz, pănh muif lanh songđ tuz stipx, nâyx huungđ pôz tauv wax huungđ pôz. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Gâyf njanh six tăng Mô-sê bix tuz njăpc taih. Năngx naih pôz cloon senz gâyf six tăng Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz taih. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Max zeengx naih mănv phătc quaix Zâu Tênb-Huungh. Cungb Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Ah Lanh Đokc Toonz cuungv, six yămz Tênb-toongh Pha cah njaf wax Tauh, wax Tauh cănh phunz pănh pâyz tuz tauv Tênb-toongh Pha.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Nây six Yô-hanx ayx zanyx manyf nyăngz wac, Yu-tai munh paiđ wax đomc stayb munh cloon Lê-wi munh tăng Yê-lu-sa-lem taih nongc naic nănh coong: “Mâyh six mănv heh?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Nănh toongx songx coong — max pyenv tiny yâuc nhlimb — coong: “Yaz six max zâyf Zâu Jix-Tuz.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Stiz naic nănh: “Ha six ayx laix? Mâyh six Ê-li-ya yah?” Nănh tauz: “Yaz max zâyf.” “Ha mâyh six Tâuc Wac Munh mah?” Nănh tauz: “Max.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Tăng wa, stiz coong ănz nănh: “Mâyh six mănv, bux buz, buz nzăngđ naih wac tauz phunz paiđ buz taih wax đomc munh? Ha mâyh cănh coong mâyh six mănv?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Nănh tauz:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Yaz six hamv stingb lub yămz wa stâyz phangz blănf coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Oix zuc ayx Zâu nyăngz jau năngx zac,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">năngđ tâuc wac munh I-sa-ya coong nâyx.” <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Tuz paiđ taih nyăngz munh six Pha-li-si wax peob munh, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Stiz naic nănh, yâuc coong ănz nănh: “Năngđ coong mâyh max zâyf Zâu Jix-Tuz, yâuc max zâyf Ê-li-ya, yâuc max zâyf Tâuc Wac Munh, ha săngh laix mâyh bix ayx quaix-gâyf heh?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yô-hanx tauz stiz coong: “Yaz nongc womz ayx quaix-gâyf. Năngx naih ah Tauh yămz nyâuh nyăngz mungh tongx six nyâuh max pâyz, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Nănh six taih đangz yaz wax Tauh, yaz lôx max payh tuz zay Nănh nyăngz stub langb.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Wax đomc dlayc setb taih six yămz Bê-ta-ni njăngv Njoh-đen wăngx toix nganc, Yô-hanx jinh đangh ayx quaix-gâyf nyăngz tinc. <verse eid="JHN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Tah nyâyc noib, Yô-hanx phătc Zâu Yê-su quaix nănh wa taih, songđ coong: “Wex, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pax jiz yuungh jenz, zaub guungh đi munh nyăngz stoif wax Tauh! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Nây six yaz coong tauv wax Tauh: ‘Nănh taih đangz yaz yâuc ayx năngx lub têx yaz wax Tauh, wâyc Nănh six yămz đangc yaz nzof.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Yaz lôx max pâyz Nănh, six wâyc phunz I-sa-la-ên pâyz tuz Nănh, yaz taih nongc womz ayx quaix-gâyf six wâyc nâyx đomc.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yô-hanx ayx zanyx manyf coong: “Yaz phătc Singx-Lingh tăng guungh nzac taih năngđ nooc coopz nâyx, bopb Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Yaz lauf max saz Nănh, six paiđ yaz nongc womz ayx quaix-gâyf wax Tauh, Nănh coong bux yaz: ‘Mâyh phătc laiv lanh munh naih Singx-Lingh nzac taih bopb yămz nănh, wax Tauh Nănh six nongc Zâu Singx-Lingh ayx quaix-gâyf gôh.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yaz tuz mangc phătc songđ ayx zanyx manyf coong, nây six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Naih ah hâyđ timb, nyâyc noib, Yô-hanx cloon nănh nyăngz iz lanh stâyb sây jinh đangh stâuđ yămz wa, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />mangc phătc Zâu Yê-su pitb wa, Yô-hanx coong: “Wex, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Pax Jiz Yuungh Jenz!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Yô-hanx wa iz lanh stayb sây numđ coong năngđ nâyx stiz songđ ninyh lêpc Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Zâu Yê-su winb đangz songđ phătc stiz taih lêpc Nănh, Nănh naic stiz: “Nyâuh lov mănv heh?” Stiz tauz Nănh: “La-bi lex, (âyz gâyf six coong ‘Stayb pha’), Mâyh yămz laiv tix heh?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Nyâuh phanv ninyh six phătc.” Tăng wa stiz songđ ninyh, phătc Nănh yămz wax nomz tinc, wax noib stiz poc wa cloon Nănh yămz. Wax zanyf six cox pyâyz săngx huđ. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Wa iz lanh numđ Yô-hanx coong naih ah lanh ninyh lêpc Zâu Yê-su, six Si-môn Pi-tê nyăngz yâuf, An-đa-lu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Tah yetx, An-đa-lu ninyh pongh nănh nyăngz tah đangc six Si-môn, songđ lănv bux nănh, coong: “Buz pongh Mê-si-ya nzof” (âyz gâyf six coong Zâu Jix-Tuz). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />An-đa-lu ênz Si-môn ninyh Zâu Yê-su wa. Tauv Zâu Yê-su phătc nănh, songđ coong: “Mâyh six Si-môn, Yô-hanx nyăngz toonz. Mâyh six hipđ ayx Cê-phatx” (wax nomz bux âyz gâyf six hipđ ayx “Pi-tê”).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Nyâyc noib, Zâu Yê-su oix gâyh wax nomz tinc ninyh wa Ga-li-lê, Nănh ninyh pongh Phi-lipx songđ bux nănh coong: “Taih lêpc Yaz gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Phi-lipx six Bêtx-sai-đa munh, lauf cloon An-đa-lu căn Pi-tê yămz ah nomz dlanyh. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Phi-lipx ninyh pongh Na-ta-na-ên yâuc coong ănz nănh: “Buz ah yac pongh Mô-sê ja yămz gâyf njanh stâub cloon wax đomc tâuc wac munh lauf coong tauv wax Tauh — Nănh six Yê-su, yămz Na-sa-leetx, Yô-sepx nyăngz toonz.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Six Na-ta-na-ên tauz nănh coong: “Lauf năngx naih tix huungđ gongx tăng Na-sa-leetx setb yah?” Phi-lipx coong ănz nănh: “Phanv ninyh mangc.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Zâu Yê-su phătc Na-ta-na-ên jinh đangh taih Nănh wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong tauv nănh: “Phanv mangc, nây six senz ah lanh I-sa-la-ên munh, yămz nâyx lanh munh senz max naih cux quaiz nyăngz jau!” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Na-ta-na-ên naic Zâu Yê-su: “Ayx laix Mâyh bix pâyz yaz?” Zâu Yê-su tauz, ănz nănh coong: “Tăng Phi-lipx max zeengx êu mâyh, Yaz phătc mâyh, yămz wa bănx tauh đi nzof gôh” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Na-ta-na-ên tauz Nănh coong: “La-bi lex, Mâyh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz! Mâyh six I-sa-la-ên munh nyăngz Huungh!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Zâu Yê-su zef tauz nănh yâuc coong: “Mâyh zen six wâyc Yaz coong ănz mâyh coong: ‘Yaz phătc mâyh yămz wa bănx tauh đi zâyf max’? Mâyh six tuz phătc đuungx huungđ dlayc năngx lub têx nây timb.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, nyâuh six phătc guungh coib goib, yâuc phătc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz stinz munh staox nzac yămz Bamh Munh cah zâyc.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Tauv wax noib pôz, naih ah phangz coonx yămz wa Ca-na njăngv, Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, Zâu Yê-su nyăngz nzif lauf yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Zâu Yê-su cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây lauf tuz êu ninyh wa coonx hinh. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Tauv tiu gaib nzuf, Zâu Yê-su nyăngz nzif coong ănz Nănh: “Stiz tiu nzuf nzof.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz nănh coong: “Nzif lex, nâyx đomc dlayc naih luungđ quenđ tauv yaz cloon nzif heh? Yaz nyăngz săngx huđ max zeengx tauv.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Zâu Yê-su nyăngz nzif coong ănz wax đomc pâuz coong: “Nănh bux nyâuh ayx laiv huungđ bix ayx âyz bex.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Yămz wa naih joz nomz njauz eengz six Yu-tai munh cănh lanyc nongc ayx stav wâyx nyăngz jau, ah nomz eengz ănz cox tuz iz pôz tongđ womz. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Oix zuc taox womz ănz wax đomc eengz năngx pong.” Tăng wa stiz songđ taox womz ănz eengz pong tekb têx beengc cah nzetx. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Nâyx zanyf phanv quab setb taih, bix nzâyz ninyh phunz cun hinh nyăngz munh gôh.” Tăng wa, stiz songđ nzâyz ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Six tauv cun hinh nyăngz munh, zangđ wax đomc womz mungv songđ numđ pênx tiu (six nănh max pâyz tiu tăng laiv tix taih, six wax đomc pâuz — quab womz nyăngz munh — stiz pâyz), jămđ hinh nyăngz munh songđ êu săngb langh taih <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />yâuc coong ănz nănh: “Muif lanh munh six tinyđ tiu cuđ đangc, tauv zeb hopb binz, nzăngđ tinyđ tiu stam lêc. Six mâyh năngx njâuh tiu cuđ tuz tauv nâyx zanyf.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Nây six tah yetx hâyđ Zâu Yê-su ayx jix caox njingc yămz Ca-na njăngv, Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, Nănh hinđ manyf Nănh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây songđ zen Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Blătc wax đomc dlayc, Zâu Yê-su, cloon Nănh nyăngz nzif cloon wax đomc yâuf, yâuc cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nzac wa Ca-bê-na-um dlanyh ninyh, six stiz lauf max yămz wa sax noib.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Cayx tauv Yu-tai munh nyăngz Pyenv Mengc Stêtz, Zâu Yê-su songđ staox wa Yê-lu-sa-lem dlanyh ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Nănh phătc yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau naih munh maic ngoongh wăngh, pax jiz yuungh cloon nooc coopz, yâuc naih cloon wănc nyanh nyăngz munh stâyv yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Nănh nongc langb binf săngh ah stinz pya tuz, songđ luiđ stiz setb bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau ninyh nzuf, njinh ngoongh wăngh cloon pax jiz yuungh, Nănh yâuc yamc wănc nyanh munh nyăngz nyanh zef njăpc cloon stiz nyăngz đah mâyf. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Nănh coong ănz wax đomc maic nooc coopz nyăngz munh: “Oix zuc nzâyz nâyx đomc setb cungh ngwaic ninyh căn. Năngx gâyf ayx Yaz Pha nyăngz pyau săngh maif maic nyăngz tinc.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Nănh wax đomc stayb sây songđ săngx tauv naih wac ja, coong: “Yaz wâyc Zâu nyăngz pyau Joomz nyâuđ năngđ tâuf sac yaz nâyx.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Wâyc nây, Yu-tai munh songđ tauz yâuc coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh cayx ayx luungđ njic hoouđ phunz buz phătc, nongc stunx coong mâyh naih gâyf ayx nâyx đomc dlayc heh?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Zâu Yê-su tauz, Nănh coong ănz stiz: “Zeb nâyx sênz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau gôh, pôz noib cah njaf yaz six zâyv nănh staox taih.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Tăng wa, Yu-tai munh coong: “Nâyx sênz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau zâyv stâyx săpc guc nyăngv nzăngđ tuz săngh, mâyh bix zâyv nănh pôz noib cah njaf naz?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Six, Nănh coong wax sênz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau six cănh coong tauv Nănh nyăngz stinb. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Năngđ nâyx, tauv Nănh tăng tayc săngh taih wax zanyf, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây songđ săngx tauv Nănh coong nâyx zâux wac, stiz songđ zen Canyx stâub cloon Zâu Yê-su coong nyăngz wac.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Zâu Yê-su yămz wa Yê-lu-sa-lem quaix Pyenv Mengc Stêtz wax dlapc, naih munh đuungx zen Nănh nyăngz manyh wâyc phătc Nănh ayx đuungx huungđ jix caox njingc nyăngz dlayc. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Six, Zâu Yê-su lauf max max mungc tauv stiz, wâyc Nănh pâyz muif lanh munh nzuf, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />nzof Nănh yâuc max sămv zuc nongc mănv ayx zanyx manyf phunz toix laiv lanh munh, wâyc Nănh cănh pâyz nzuf muif lanh munh nyăngz nyâuđ.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Wax zanyf, naih ah lanh Pha-li-si munh wax đomc munh, bux hipđ ayx Ni-cô-đê-matx, nănh six cun Yu-tai munh nyăngz, ah lanh ayx côx munh. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Bah nzămc nâyx lanh munh ninyh pongh Zâu Yê-su, yâuc coong ănz Nănh: “Stênx steengb lex, buz pâyz coong Mâyh six ah lanh stênx steengb tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih, năngđ coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh max cloon yămz, six max naih mănv hayh ayx tuz nâyx đomc jix caox njingc nyăngz dlayc, năngđ Mâyh ayx nyăngz nâyx.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh coong: “Yaz coong senz bux mâyh, Năngđ coong laiv lanh max tuz steengb timb, wax tauh six max hayh tuz phătc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Ni-cô-đê-matx coong ănz Nănh: “Ah lanh munh côx nzof, laiv hayh ayx laix steengb timb heh? Wax tauh munh zef năngx hayh nzac nzif nyăngz nyâuđ njaf ninyh, bix zef steengb nyâyc hâyđ naz?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Yaz coong senz bux mâyh, năngđ coong laiv lanh max tăng womz cloon Singx-Lingh steengb taih, wax lanh munh six max hayh tuz nzac Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Laiv huungđ tăng stinb a steengb six stinb a, laiv huungđ tăng Singx-Lingh steengb six mengc hoonh. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Yaz coong bux mâyh nyăngz dlayc năngx gâyf numđ nyâyh ganc: ‘Mâyh six năngx sămv zuc tuz stengb timb.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Nzaox oix sâyb laiv bix sâyb, mâyh numđ nzaox nyăngz stingb, six mâyh max pâyz nzaox tăng laiv taih, yâuc max pâyz nzaox cayx ninyh tauv laiv. Tinyh phanv laiv lanh tăng Singx-Lingh steengb taih six lauf năngđ nâyx.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Ni-cô-đê-matx zef naic Nănh coong: “Laiv ayx laix tuz wax đomc dlayc setb taih heh?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh coong: “Mâyh six I-sa-la-ên munh nyăngz stênx steengb, mâyh bix lauf max pâyz wax đomc jau naz? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Yaz coong senz bux mâyh, buz coong buz pâyz quaix nyăngz jau, buz phătc quaix nyăngz buz yâuc ayx zanyx manyf, six nyâuh max stipx buz nyăngz zanyx manyf wac. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Năngđ coong yaz coong nây bamh canz nyăngz jau bux nyâuh, bix nyâuh lôx max zen, năngđ nâyx yaz coong cah zâyc guungh nyăngz jau bux nyâuh, nyâuh bix laiv ayx laix hayh zen heh? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Max zeengx naih mănv tuz staox guungh ninyh setb nzuf tăng guungh taih wax Tauh — six Bamh munh. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Mô-sê yămz wa stâyz phangz blănf njăpc nangz staox njăngb ayx năngđ laix, six Bamh Munh lauf zuc zoz njăpc staox njăngb năngđ wa nâyx, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />nongc phunz laiv lanh munh zen tauv Nănh six tuz naih stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh senz stăngz guungh đi munh, ayx tuz sađ Nănh nyăngz ah tauh Đokc Toonz, phunz laiv lanh zen wax tauh Toonz six max zuc mêtc, yâuc tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh paiđ Nănh nyăngz Toonz nzac bamh canz taih, max zâyf nongc tingc bamh munh nyăngz stoif, six phunz bamh munh păngc wax tauh Toonz bix tuz njâuv. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Laiv lanh zen wax tauh Toonz songđ max zuc tingc stoif, six laiv lanh max zen yâuc zuc tingc stoif nzof gôh, wâyc nănh max zen Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz ah tauh đokc Toonz nyăngz manyh. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Nây six zuc tingc stoif nyăngz jau, wâyc: gwăngz nzac nây bamh canz taih, six munh oix nongc nzămc năngx nzongf têx gwăngz wâyc stiz ayx nyăngz jau six huđ nzongf. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Wâyc ayx huđ nyăngz munh six hănđ gwăngz, yâuc max oix taih lov gwăngz, phunz nănh ayx nyăngz jau max zuc setb yangh taih. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Six, laiv lanh âyz senz gâyf ayx yâuc taih lov gwăngz, phunz nănh ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz tuz setb nzăngc taih, phunz stunx coong, wax đomc cumh pâuz six păngc Zâu Tênb-Huungh ayx.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Blătc wax đomc dlayc, Zâu Yê-su cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nzac wa Yu-đê stâyz phangz ninyh. Nănh cloon stayb sây buz yămz wa yâuc ayx quaix-gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Six, Yô-hanx lauf năngx jinh yămz wa Atc-nôn ayx quaix-gâyf gâyh Sa-lim max côz, wâyc yămz wa naih womz đuungx, songx munh songđ tinyh ênz taih wa ayx quaix-gâyf — <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />wax zanyf Yô-hanx six max zeengx zuc zoz ănz nzauh. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Tăng wa, Yô-hanx nyăngz stayb sây căn ah lanh Yu-tai munh naih tinyh zenđ setb taih, coong tauv stav wâyx nyăngz jau. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Stiz songđ ninyh Yô-hanx wa yâuc coong ănz nănh: “La-bi lex, cah đangc cloon mâyh yămz wa Njoh-đen wăngx wax tauh munh, mâyh bix ayx zanyx manyf phunz wax tauh munh, phanv mangc geh, Nănh jinh đangh yămz wa ayx quaix-gâyf, songx munh muif lanh yâuc tinyh đoih ninyh Nănh wa.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yô-hanx tauz yâuc coong: “Năngđ coong wax đomc max zâyf tăng guungh sađ phunz wax lanh munh, six max naih mănv hayh stipx tuz luungđ, hănđ ah huungđ lauf max tuz. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Nyâuh cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz, yaz coong: ‘Yaz six max zâyf Zâu Jix-Tuz,’ six ‘yaz tuz paiđ taih đangc Nănh.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Laiv lanh nzăngđ zoz au six săngb langh. Nzof săngb langh nyăngz lah pyeoz toic, six stâuđ yămz wa mungv săngb langh, yâuc numđ nyađ mungv săngb langh nyăngz stingb. Lauf tinyh năngđ, nây six senz yaz nyăngz numđ nyađ gôh. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Nănh six tuz pâuh staox njăngb, yaz six zuc sămc nzac hav.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Tăng guungh taih wax Tauh six năngx lub quaix. Laiv lanh tăng bamh canz setb taih six săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, yâuc cungb coong bamh canz nyăngz jau cuungv. Six tăng guungh taih wax Tauh six năngx lub quaix muif lanh. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Nănh ayx zanyx manyf coong tauv Nănh tuz phătc căn tuz numđ nyăngz, six max naih mănv stipx Nănh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Laiv lanh stipx Nănh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac, yâuc ayx zanyx manyf coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh six senz nyăngz. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh paiđ taih wax Tauh six coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz wac. Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh sađ Singx-Lingh phunz Nănh six max hayh pong stâuv. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tênb-toongh Pha stăngz Nănh nyăngz Toonz songđ jaoz muif huungđ yămz Nănh nyăngz puf đi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Laiv lanh zen Nănh nyăngz Toonz six tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, six laiv lanh max zen mungc Nănh nyăngz Toonz six max hayh tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, six Zâu Tênb-Huungh tingc stoif nyăngz jau, yâuc năngx jinh yămz nănh gôh.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Tăng wa, tauv Zâu Yê-su pâyz tuz Pha-li-si munh numđ coong Nănh zef quef coonz, yâuc ayx quaix-gâyf phunz stayb sây năngx đuungx têx Yô-hanx <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(senz six max zâyf Zâu Yê-su ayx quaix-gâyf, six Nănh wax đomc stayb sây ayx lêc), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Zâu Yê-su songđ gâyh wa Yu-đê bix zef muf wa Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Six hănđ ayx laix Nănh lauf zuc pitb quaix wa Sa-ma-đi muf. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Tăng wa Nănh muf tauv ah nomz dlanyh yămz Sa-ma-đi stâyz phangz, hipđ ayx Si-ca, yămz stătx Ya-côpx, tanb phunz nănh nyăngz toonz, Yô-sepx wax phănc nib. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Yămz wa naih Ya-côpx nyăngz womz cotb. Wâyc Zâu Yê-su ninyh jau conv, Nănh songđ stâyv yămz wa womz cotb cah sinh. Wax zanyx six cox săpc nyâyc săngx huđ. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Naih ah lanh Sa-ma-đi munh nzif taih wa quab womz, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Joođ phunz yaz hopb tix cay womz jađ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Wâyc Nănh wax đomc stayb sây stiz nzac wa steengv cah njaf ninyh nongc maif tax huungđ nhlinc. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Tăng wa wax tauh Sa-ma-đi munh nzif coong ănz Nănh “Mâyh six ah lanh Yu-tai munh săngh laix bix năngx joođ yaz nyăngz womz hopb, yaz six ah lanh Sa-ma-đi munh nzif?” (Wâyc Yu-tai munh six max cloon Sa-ma-đi munh tinyh plongx.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Zâu Yê-su tauz, wax tauh munh nzif coong: “Mâyh năngđ coong pâyz tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pôz, yâuc pâyz tuz naic mâyh coong: ‘Joođ phunz tix cay womz yaz hopb,’ wax tauh six mănv, mâyh six bâyf joođ wax tauh, Nănh six sađ săngh mengc womz phunz mâyh hopb.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Wax tauh munh nzif coong ănz Nănh: “Tah lex, mâyh max naih zuib quab womz, womz cotb yâuc đôz. Ha, tăng laiv mâyh bix naih wax đomc săngh mengc womz heh? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ha mâyh bix năngx lub têx buz nyăngz claof jex Ya-côpx naz, nănh njâuh nâyx nomz womz cotb phunz buz, yâuc tăng nâyx nomz womz cotb, bix nănh căn nănh nyăngz pyau munh cloon nănh nyăngz steengb hauđ nzăngđ tuz hopb?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Zâu Yê-su tauz yâuc bux nănh coong: “Laiv lanh hopb nâyx nomz womz cotb six năngx jinh hayh nyâuđ gatb, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />six laiv lanh hopb yaz phunz nyăngz womz, songđ stâyv quâyx max hayh nyâuđ gatb, tauv banc stâyv banc đaic. Yaz phunz nyăngz womz six năngđ ah nomz womz sting, yămz wax lanh munh cah njaf pumh staox taih, ninyh tauv stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Wax lanh munh nzif coong ănz Nănh: “Tah lex, joođ phunz wax đomc womz yaz, phunz yaz nzăngđ max zuc nyâuđ gatb, yâuc max zuc taih nây quab womz.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Zâu Yê-su bux nănh: “Phanv muf, êu mâyh nyăngz langh taih nây.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Wax tauh munh nzif tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz max naih langh.” Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Mâyh coong senz toix nzongf, coong: ‘Yaz max naih langh,’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />wâyc mâyh zoz pyaz toongv langh, nâyx zanyf cloon mâyh yămz wax lanh munh six max zâyf mâyh nyăngz langh! Mâyh coong nyăngz wac six senz toix!” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Wax tauh munh nzif coong ănz Nănh: “Tah lex, yaz pâyz coong mâyh six ah lanh tâuc wac munh. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Buz nyăngz claof jex six yămz nâyx nomz zoongz canyx bongc, six nyâuh yâuc coong munh zuc canyx bongc nyăngz tinc six yămz wa Yê-lu-sa-lem.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz wax tauh munh nzif coong: “Ô lex, phanv zen yaz, săngx huđ tauv, nyâuh canyx bongc Tênb-toongh Pha six max zâyf yămz nâyx nomz zoongz, lauf max zâyf yămz wa Yê-lu-sa-lem. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nyâuh canyx bongc nyăngz nyâuh max pâyz. Buz canyx bongc nyăngz buz pâyz, wâyc njâuv pôz nyăngz jau six tăng Yu-tai munh taih. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Six, săngx huđ tauv, yâuc tauv gôh, senz canyx bongc Tênb-toongh Pha nyăngz munh, six nongc stimz nyâuđ căn senz gâyf canyx bongc, wâyc Tênb-toongh Pha six lov nâyx huungđ munh, nongc canyx bongc Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Zâu Tênb-Huungh six Stinz, wâyc nâyx laiv lanh canyx bongc Nănh six zuc nongc stimz nyâuđ cloon senz gâyf canyx bongc” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Wax tauh munh nzif coong ănz Nănh coong: “Yaz pâyz tuz Mê-si-ya wax Tauh (Nănh six hipđ ayx Zâu Jix-Tuz) cayx taih. Tauv Nănh taih, Nănh six coong muif huungđ jau bux buz nzuf.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Zâu Yê-su tauz wax tauh munh nzif: “Six yaz gôh, jinh đangh căn mâyh coong wac nyăngz munh.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây phunb đangz lauf phătc, stiz songđ numđ njingc nzongf, wâyc phătc Zâu Yê-su jinh đangh căn ah lanh munh nzif coong wac. Hănđ nâyx, lauf max naih mănv naic coong: “Stayb pha naic luungđ heh?” max six coong: “Săngh laix stayb pha bix căn wax tauh munh nzif coong wac?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Tăng wa, wax tauh munh nzif songđ quanyf nănh nyăngz womz eengz ănz wa, nănh bix nzac wa steengv muf, yâuc coong bux songx munh: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Phanv ninyh mangc, naih ah lanh munh, nănh coong nzuf yaz yaz ayx quaix nyăngz muif huungđ dlayc. Nâyx bix max zâyf Zâu Jix-Tuz mah?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Songx munh songđ tinyh ênz setb wa steengv ninyh Zâu Yê-su wa. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Yămz wax đomc săngx huđ congv, stayb sây buz yac Nănh, coong: “La-bi lex, joođ nhlinc gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Six Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Yaz naih ah huungđ nhlinc hopb yuungf yaz six nyâuh max pâyz.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Tăng wa, stayb sây buz lanh coong ănz lanh: “Sangx naih tix lanh munh nzâyz tix huungđ taih phunz stayb pha nhlinc lêc baz?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz stiz coong: “Yaz nyăngz nhlinc hopb six ayx âyz paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh nyăngz zux ix, yâuc ayx săngh Nănh nyăngz cumh pâuz. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Max zâyf nyâuh coong: ‘Năngx naih pyâyz lav timb, six tauv sâub zunb’ nâyx haz? Six, yaz coong bux nyâuh, nyâuh phanv zaub minb mangc staox wax đomc njăngx njingh blauh ninyh, wâyc blauh wăngh nzuf nzof beengc săngx huđ stâub zunb gôh! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Stâub nyăngz munh tuz stipx congz nyanh yâuc stâub tuz phunz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, nzof hav nyăngz munh cloon sâub nyăngz munh songđ tinyh đoih numđ nyađ. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Wâyc nâyx zâux wac senz toix nzongf coong: ‘Nâyx lanh six ninyh songx, nzof wax lanh six ninyh stâub.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Yaz paiđ nyâuh ninyh stâub nyâuh max zuc ayx zâuđ nyăngz tax huungđ. Pitc lanh zuc ayx zâuđ, nzof nyâuh six nzac ninyh stipx stiz nyăngz jab nongc.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wax zanyf, naih đuungx lanh Sa-ma-đi munh, yămz wax nomz steengv zen Zâu Yê-su, wâyc wax tauh munh nzif ayx nyăngz zanyx manyf wac, coong: “Nănh coong nzuf yaz ayx quaix nyăngz muif huungđ dlayc.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Năngđ nâyx wax đomc Sa-ma-đi munh songđ taih pongh Zâu Yê-su, stiz joođ Nănh cloon stiz yămz wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ yămz wa iz noib. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Tauv tuz numđ Nănh nyăngz wac, munh zef zen năngx đuungx têx timb. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Stiz coong ănz wax tauh munh nzif coong: “Nâyx zanyf max zâyf wâyc mâyh nyăngz wac bux bix zen, six wâyc buz cănh tuz numđ, buz pâyz coong nâyx lanh munh, senz zâyf bamh munh nyăngz Njâuv Zâu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Blătc wa iz noib, Zâu Yê-su setb wax nomz tinc ninyh wa Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Wâyc Zâu Yê-su cănh coong, tâuc wac nyăngz munh six max tuz nănh nyăngz njăngv njaf munh zanyb. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Wâyc nâyx, Nănh ninyh tauv Ga-li-lê wax zanyf, Ga-li-lê munh songđ taih stipx Nănh, wâyc stiz tuz phătc Nănh yămz wa Yê-lu-sa-lem, ayx nyăngz muif huungđ dlayc, yămz wax đomc quaix stêtz nyăngz noib, wâyc stiz lauf ninyh wa quaix stêtz.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Blătc wa, Zâu Yê-su zef ninyh tauv Ca-na dlanyh, yămz Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, six Nănh wav womz ayx săngh tiu wax nomz tinc, naih ah lanh quanz lub, nănh nyăngz toonz jinh đangh săngh gumc yămz wa Ca-bê-na-um. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Numđ lănv coong Zâu Yê-su tăng Yu-đê stâyz phangz lauf tauv wa Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, wax tauh quanz lub songđ ninyh pongh Zâu Yê-su, joođ êu Zâu Yê-su ninyh zany nănh nyăngz toonz, wâyc wax tauh toonz cayx tayc gôh. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz Nănh: “Năngđ coong nyâuh max phătc wax đomc jix caox njingc cloon wax đomc njic hoouđ, nyâuh six max zen.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Wax tauh quanz lub coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Zâu lex, joođ mâyh coonx ninyh, wangb yaz nyăngz toonz hayh tayc.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Zâu Yê-su bux nănh: “Phanv muf gôh, mâyh nyăngz toonz năngx săngh.” Nâyx lanh quanz songđ zen Zâu Yê-su bux nănh nyăngz wac, nănh bix muf. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Nănh năngx jinh muf jau wax zanyf, nănh wax đomc pâuz taih pongh nănh yâuc bux nănh coong, mâyh nyăngz toonz lauf năngx jinh săngh. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Năngđ nâyx, nănh zah naic stiz toix laiv săngx huđ toonz jenz bix tuz numđ gongx. Tăng wa stiz tauz nănh coong: “Cumh noib, cox ah săngx huđ, bah song gumc bix gâyh nănh.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Wâyc nây, wax tauh pha pâyz tuz coong senz toix Zâu Yê-su bux nănh wax săngx huđ: “Mâyh nyăngz toonz năngx jinh săngh.” Nănh songđ cloon nănh nyăngz pyau munh tinyh đoih zen nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Nây six Zâu Yê-su tăng Yu-đê steengv phunb đangz lauf wa Ga-li-lê, ayx tah nyâyc hâyđ nyăngz jix caox njingc.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Blătc wax đomc dlayc, naih Yu-tai munh nyăngz ah nomz stêtz, Zâu Yê-su songđ ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem dlanyh. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Wax zanyf, yămz wa Yê-lu-sa-lem, stătx Pax Jiz Yuungh Jeengh sinh, naih ah nomz glangh, Hipđ-lu wac six hipđ ayx Bêtc-sa-ta, naih pyaz nomz tungh sec njiuh. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Yămz wa naih ah peob gumc munh hongđ nzongf, mâyc buđ, puf quac, staux quac, săngh gumc quac max hayh tongf stinb phâyx yămz wax đomc njiuh. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />[Wâyc naih ah tauh Zâu nyăngz stinz munh toix lauh zanyf hayh nzac glangh taih ayx phunz womz tongf, womz tongf wax zanyf, laiv lanh japc nzac ninyh đangc, nănh hănđ săngh laiv huungđ gumc six tuz gongx nzuf.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Yămz wa naih ah lanh munh, nănh săngh gumc tuz stamx săpc pêtz nyăngv. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Zâu Yê-su phătc nâyx lanh munh phâyx yămz wa, yâuc pâyz coong nănh săngh gumc lauh nzongf, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz nănh: “Mâyh oix tuz gongx max?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Gumc munh tauz Nănh: “Zâu lex, womz tongf wax zanyf max naih mănv ênz yaz nzac glangh ninyh. Six, yaz jinh đangh nzac glangh ninyh wax zanyf, pitc lanh munh bâyf ninyh nzac đangc yaz nzof.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Zâu Yê-su bux nănh coong: “Phanv nyoongz quef, đamz mâyh nyăngz zâuv bix muf gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Wax tauh munh pha, toongx sangf tuz gongx nzuf, nănh songđ đamz nănh nyăngz zâuv, bix muf.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Wax noib six toix tingc congz noib. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Wâyc nây Yu-tai munh songđ coong ănz tuz zany gongx wax lanh munh: “Nâyx noib six toix tingc congz noib, mâyh max tuz đamz mâyh nyăngz zâuv.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Six nănh tauz stiz coong: “Zany yaz tuz gongx wax lanh, nănh cănh êu yaz coong: ‘Phanv đamz mâyh nyăngz zâuv bix muf gôh.’” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Stiz naic nănh: “Bux mâyh coong ‘Phanv đamz zâuv bix muf gôh’ wax tauh six mănv heh?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Six, tuz zany gongx wax lanh munh yâuc max pâyz coong mănv, wâyc Zâu Yê-su nzac yămz wa nyăngz munh hongđ cah njaf ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Blătc wa quaix đangz, Zâu Yê-su pongh nănh yămz wa bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau, songđ coong ănz nănh: “Phanv mangc, mâyh tuz gongx nzuf nzof! Năngx gâyf pamf stoif gôh, phunz max naih luungđ huđ nyăngz jau taih hoiđ zuc mâyh.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Nâyx lanh munh pha songđ ninyh bux ănz Yu-tai munh coong, zany phunz nănh tuz gongx, wax lanh munh six Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Wâyc năngđ nây, Yu-tai munh songđ ayx huđ ănz Zâu Yê-su, wâyc Nănh ayx wax đomc dlayc toix tingc congz noib. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Six Zâu Yê-su coong bux stiz: “Yaz nyăngz Pha lauf năngx jinh ayx cumh pâuz tauv nâyx zanyf, yaz lauf ayx cumh pâuz năngđ nâyx.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Wâyc nâyx đomc wac, Yu-tai munh zef oix lov jau tayx Nănh năngx nzongf têx timb, wâyc Nănh max zâyf cungb pamf tingc congz noib cuungv, six zef năngx hipđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh ayx Nănh nyăngz Pha, cănh ayx phunz Nănh căn Zâu Tênb-Huungh tinyh năngđ.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su zef tauz ănz stiz coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, Toonz max hayh cănh âyz nănh nyăngz nyâuđ ayx tuz laiv huungđ, blătc nzuf nănh phătc Pha ayx wax đomc, wâyc Pha ayx toix laiv huungđ Toonz six lauf ayx wax huungđ. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Tênb-toongh Pha stăngz Nănh nyăngz Toonz songđ phunz Nănh nyăngz Toonz phătc Nănh ayx nyăngz muif huungđ dlayc, Nănh six phunz Nănh nyăngz Toonz phătc wax đomc dlayc năngx lub têx nây timb Phunz nyâuh numđ nyâyh ganc. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Wâyc Tênb-toongh Pha ayx phunz munh tayc săngh taih yâuc sađ phunz stiz naih săngh mengc năngđ laix, six Nănh nyăngz Toonz lauf sađ săngh mengc phunz Nănh oix phunz nyăngz munh năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tênb-toongh Pha lauf max stămđ mănv, six Nănh jaoz nzuf lanyf phunz Nănh nyăngz Toonz stămđ, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />phunz muif lanh munh zanyb Nănh nyăngz Toonz lauf năngđ stiz zanyb Tênb-toongh Pha nâyx. Laiv lanh max zanyb Nănh nyăngz Toonz six lauf max zanyb Tênb-toongh Pha, senz paiđ Toonz taih wax Tauh. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh mungv yaz nyăngz wac yâuc zen paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh six tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, wax lanh songđ max zuc tingc stoif, six senz tuz gâyh đutb tayc yâuc tuz naih săngh mengc. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh săngx huđ cayx tauv gôh, nzof tauv wax zanyf, wax đomc munh tayc six tuz numđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz nyăngz stingb, nzof laiv lanh mungv numđ six tuz săngh. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Wâyc Tênb-toongh Pha naih săngh mengc yămz Nănh ayx năngđ laix, Nănh lauf sađ phunz Nănh nyăngz Toonz naih săngh mengc yămz Nănh năngđ wa nâyx, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Tênb-toongh Pha jaoz lanyf phunz Nănh nyăngz Toonz stămđ stoif, wâyc Nănh nyăngz Toonz six Bamh Munh. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Năngx gâyf numđ nyâyh ganc nâyx đomc jau, wâyc săngx huđ tauv wax zanyf, yămz wa stâu nyăngz munh, muif lanh six tuz numđ Nănh nyăngz stingb <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />stiz songđ setb wa stâu taih — laiv lanh ayx gongx six săngh taih nongc tuz săngh, six laiv lanh ayx huđ six săngh taih nongc tingc stoif.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Yaz max hayh cănh păngc yaz ayx toix laiv huungđ. Yaz six âyz yaz numđ quaix nyăngz bix stămđ, yaz six peengh stimz nyăngz stămđ, wâyc yaz max zâyf cănh âyz yaz nyăngz zux ix, six âyz paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh nyăngz zux ix. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Năngđ coong yaz cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz, yaz nyăngz zanyx manyf wac six max săngh zen. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Naih ah lanh munh, cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz, yaz pâyz coong wax tauh munh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz six senz nyăngz. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nyâuh paiđ munh ninyh pongh Yô-hanx, nănh yâuc ayx zanyx manyf phunz senz gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Yaz hănđ max stipx tăng bamh munh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac, six yaz coong nâyx đomc jau, six nongc phunz nyâuh hayh tuz njâuv. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yô-hanx six ah zây toongz pu sac yâuc siux gwăngz, nyâuh yâuc numđ nyađ yămz nănh nyăngz gwăngz ah dlapc. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Six yaz naih nyăngz zanyx manyf, năngx lub têx Yô-hanx nyăngz zanyx manyf: nây six Pha jaoz phunz yaz wax đomc cumh pâuz, yaz zuc ayx săngh năngx nzuf — six yaz ayx nâyx đomc nyăngz cumh pâuz — cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz coong Tênb-toongh Pha senz paiđ yaz taih. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tênb-toongh Pha cănh paiđ yaz taih, Nănh yâuc ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz. Nyâuh max zeengx tuz numđ quaix Nănh nyăngz stingb, yâuc max zeengx phătc quaix Nănh nyăngz minb. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Nyâuh max naih Nănh nyăngz wac yămz nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ, wâyc nyâuh max zen Nănh paiđ taih wax Tauh. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nyâuh zah Canyx Stâub mangc wâyc nyâuh nyâyh coong păngc wa bix tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, wax đomc wac six ayx zanyx manyf coong tauv yaz, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Nyâuh yâuc max oix taih lov yaz nongc tuz naih săngh mengc. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Yaz max stipx tăng bamh munh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Six, yaz pâyz coong nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ cah njaf, max naih stăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Yaz yămz yaz nyăngz Pha nyăngz manyh taih, nyâuh yâuc max stipx yaz. Six năngđ coong naih pitc lanh munh nongc nănh cănh nyăngz manyh taih, nyâuh six stipx wax lanh munh. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Nyâuh laiv ayx laix hayh zen heh, wâyc nyâuh stipx tăng munh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, bix max lov tăng ah tauh Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih nyăngz gwăngz eeng? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Năngx gâyf nyâyh coong yaz yămz Tênb-toongh Pha nyăngz cah đangc cooux nyâuh. Cooux nyâuh wax tauh six Mô-sê, nyâuh nyâyh mungc wax tauh. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Năngđ coong nyâuh zen Mô-sê, nyâuh six lauf zen yaz, wâyc Mô-sê six ja coong tauv yaz. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Six năngđ coong nyâuh max zen nănh ja nyăngz wac, nyâuh bix ayx laix hayh zen yaz nyăngz wac?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Blătc wax đomc dlayc, Zâu Yê-su quaix wax nganđ leepz Ga-li-lê coiđ sinh ninyh (six hipđ ayx Ti-bê-lêtx). <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Naih ah peob songx munh hongđ nzongf ninyh lêpc Nănh, wâyc stiz tuz phătc quaix Nănh ayx jix caox njingc zany gongx wax đomc gumc munh. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su songđ staox wa zoongz ninyh, Nănh songđ cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây stâyv yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />(Wax zanyf, six cayx tauv Pyenv Mengc Stêtz, six Yu-tai munh nyăngz stêtz.) <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zaub minb mangc phătc songx munh hongđ nzongf taih Nănh wa, songđ coong ănz Phi-lipx: “Pănh cayx maif laiv tix nzu phunz nâyx đomc munh nhlinc heh?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />(Zâu Yê-su naic ayx nâyx six nongc stâyv nănh, wâyc Nănh cayx ayx năngđ laix Nănh pâyz nzuf nzof.) <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Phi-lipx tauz Nănh coong: “Nongc iz pez noib congz nyanh maif nzu lauf max caux patz phunz stiz ah lanh tuz tix cay.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Zâu Yê-su wax đomc ah lanh stayb sây, six Si-môn Pi-tê nyăngz yâuf, An-đa-lu, tauz nănh coong: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Yămz nây naih ah lanh toonz jenz nănh naih pyaz nomz ba-li blauh nzu cloon iz tauh byauf, six munh hongđ tuz nâyx cungb nâyx tix bix laiv caux heh?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Zâu Yê-su coong: “Phanv êu munh tinyh đoih stâyv nzac.” (Wax zanyf yămz wax cuyb tinc six naih mađ đuungx.) Năngđ nâyx, stâyv wa nyăngz munh pha, cox naih pyaz tinb lanh. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su nzauf wax đomc nzu sâuf hâuđ tuz, Nănh songđ patz phunz stâyv wa nyăngz munh nhlinc, byauf lauf ayx năngđ ha, munh oix buc laiv yâuc tuz âyz stimz. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Tăng wa, tauv songx munh nhlinc pêu nzuf, Zâu Yê-su bux Nănh wax đomc stayb sây coong: “Oix zuc ninyh stâub nhlinc yăngc wax đomc, năngx gâyf ayx huđ laiv huungđ tinyh.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Năngđ nây, tăng wa pyaz nomz ba-li blauh nzu, songx munh nhlinc tuz, stiz stâub wax đomc nzu yăngc, tuz săpc nyâyc đanz pong. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Wâyc, wax đomc munh phătc Zâu Yê-su ayx nyăngz jix caox njingc, songđ coong: “Nâyx lanh munh senz zâyf oix zuc taih bamh canz wax Tauh tâuc wac munh gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Tăng wa, wâyc pâyz coong stiz cayx taih yac Nănh nongc pâuh Nănh ayx huungh, Nănh songđ pyenv staox wa zoongz ninyh ah lanh yămz wa.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Wax zanyf, tauv cayx nzămc, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây nzac wa coiđ lauf, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />stiz nzac đangđ ninyh, clăngv quaix wax nganđ leepz coiđ sinh muf huungv ninyh wa Ca-bê-na-um, wax zanyf, guungh yâuc nzămc meengh nzof, six Zâu Yê-su lauf max zeengx taih stiz wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Wâyc naih ah tâuc nzaox njoongh nzongf stâyb wa coiđ songđ naih womz boomf. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Tâuc tuz cox pyaz joz gâyf, stayb sây buz phătc Zâu Yê-su yăngh womz minc taih stătx wa đangđ, stiz songđ cumh nzav nzongf. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Six Zâu Yê-su bux stiz coong: “Yaz lêc! Năngx gâyf cumh nzav!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Wax zanyf, stiz ah stipx Nănh nzac đangđ ninyh, đangđ songđ toongx sangf zapz wa coiđ sinh, six stiz cayx ninyh nyăngz tinc.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Tauv nyâyc noib, songx munh lauf năngx jinh yămz wax leepz coiđ sinh, yâuc phătc blătc wax saz đangđ max naih pitc saz đangđ yămz wa, wâyc phătc Zâu Yê-su lauf max cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây buz nzac đangđ, cungb phătc Nănh wax đomc stayb sây buz ninyh cuungv. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Tăng wa, naih ah đomc đangđ tăng Ti-bê-lêtx taih yămz stătx Zâu sâuf hâuđ nzu phunz songx munh nhlinc wax cuyb tinc. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Wâyc nây, songx munh phătc Zâu Yê-su cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây max yămz wa, stiz songđ nzac đangđ ninyh quaix wa Ca-bê-na-um muf lov Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Lov pongh Nănh yămz wax nganđ leepb coiđ sinh wax zanyf, songx munh naic Nănh coong: “La-bi lex, mâyh laiv zanyf taih nây heh?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, nyâuh taih lov yaz six max zâyf wâyc nyâuh phătc wax đomc jix caox njingc, six wâyc nyâuh tuz nzu nhlinc pêu. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Năngx gâyf ayx cumh pâuz wâyc hayh yootz nyăngz nhlinc hopb, six ayx wâyc tuz stâyv quâyc nyăngz mengc nyăngz nhlinc hopb, six Bamh Munh sađ phunz nyâuh wax huungđ, wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh six Pha, tăpb yenx ănz Nănh nzof.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Tăng wa stiz coong ănz Nănh: “Buz zuc ayx luungđ, buz nzăngđ hayh tuz ayx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cumh pâuz?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Nây six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cumh pâuz, nyâuh six oix zuc zen Nănh paiđ taih wax Tauh.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Stiz songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Ha mâyh ayx laiv huungđ jix caox njingc phunz buz phătc bix zen mâyh? Mâyh ayx luungđ cumh pâuz heh? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Buz nyăngz claof jex yămz wa stâyz phangz blănf nhlinc ma-na, năngđ naih wac ja coong: ‘Nănh sađ nzu tăng guungh nzac taih phunz stiz nongc nhlinc.’” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su zef tauz stiz coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, max zâyf Mô-sê sađ nzu tăng guungh taih phunz nyâuh, six yaz nyăngz Pha sađ senz nyăngz nzu tăng guungh taih phunz nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz nzu six tăng guungh nzac taih nyăngz nzu yâuc phunz bamh munh tuz naih săngh mengc.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Tăng wa, stiz coong ănz Nănh: “Stênx steengb lex, joođ sađ phunz buz stâyv quâyx naih wax đomc nzu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Yaz six săngh mengc nyăngz nzu. Laiv lanh taih lêpc yaz six max zuc nyâuđ sab, nzof laiv lanh zen păngc yaz six stâyv quâyx max nyâuđ gatb. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Six yaz tuz bux nyâuh coong, nyâuh tuz phătc yaz, six nyâuh max zen. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Pha jaoz phunz yaz nyăngz munh tauv laiv six cănh taih lêpc yaz, laiv lanh taih lêpc yaz, yaz six max quanyf. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Wâyc yaz tăng guungh nzac taih six max zâyf âyz yaz cănh nyăngz zux ix, six âyz paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh nyăngz zux ix. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Nây six paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh nyăngz âyx, Tênb-toongh Pha jaoz phunz yaz wax đomc munh, Nănh max oix yaz phunz laiv lanh gaih ninyh, six tauv stêtb mâyv nyăngz noib, oix yaz ayx phunz wax đomc munh tuz săngh taih. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Nây six yaz nyăngz Pha nyăngz âyx, tinyh phanv laiv lanh phătc Nănh nyăngz Toonz yâuc zen caođ Nănh nyăngz Toonz, six tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, nzof tauv stêtb mâyv nyăngz noib, yaz six ayx phunz wax lanh munh tuz săngh taih.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Tăng wa, Yu-tai munh songđ yônx Nănh wâyc Nănh coong: “Yaz six tăng guungh nzac taih nyăngz nzu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Stiz coong: “Lâyc tauh max zâyf Yê-su, Yô-sepx nyăngz toonz nănh nyăngz nzif pha pănh lauf pâyz? Ha săngh laix nâyx zanyf Nănh bix coong six: ‘Yaz tăng guungh taih’?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Nyâuh năngx gâyf lanh yônx ănz lanh gôh. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Max naih mănv hayh taih lov yaz, năngđ coong Tênb-toongh Pha, paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh, max ênz nănh taih, tauv stêtb mâyv nyăngz noib, yaz six ayx phunz wax lanh munh tuz săngh taih. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Wax đomc tâuc wac munh nyăngz stâub naih ja coong: ‘Muif lanh six tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nzaox.’ Toix laiv lanh mungv Tênb-toongh Pha, yâuc hoođ âyz Nănh six taih lov yaz. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Wâyc max naih mănv phătc quaix Tênb-toongh Pha, cungb tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih wax Tauh — Nănh tuz phătc Tênb-toongh Pha cuungv. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh zen six tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Yaz six săngh mengc nyăngz nzu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Nyâuh nyăngz claof jex yămz wa stâyz phangz blănf nhlinc ma-na, stiz lauf tayc nzof. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Nây six tăng guungh nzac taih nyăngz nzu, phunz toix laiv lanh nhlinc nây nzu six max tayc. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Yaz six săngh nyăngz nzu, tăng guungh nzac taih. Năngđ coong laiv lanh nhlinc nây nzu, wax tauh six tuz stâyv quâyx săngh. Yaz sađ phunz nyăngz nzu six cănh yaz nyăngz a, wâyc phunz bamh munh tuz săngh.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Năngđ nâyx Yu-tai munh songđ tinyh nzeengz, coong: “Ayx laix lâyc tauh munh bix cayx phunz pănh nhlinc nănh nyăngz a?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su bux stiz coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, năngđ coong nyâuh max nhlinc Bamh Munh nyăngz a yâuc max hopb Nănh nyăngz samđ, yămz nyâuh six max naih săngh mengc. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Laiv lanh nhlinc yaz nyăngz a yâuc hopb yaz nyăngz samđ six tuz naih stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, tauv stêtb mâyv wax noib yaz six ayx phunz wax lanh munh tuz săngh taih. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Wâyc yaz nyăngz a cloon yaz nyăngz samđ, six senz nyăngz nhlinc hopb. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Laiv lanh nhlinc yaz nyăngz a yâuc hopb yaz nyăngz samđ, wax tauh yămc yaz cah njaf, yaz lauf yămz wax tauh cah njaf. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Cayx năngđ săngh nyăngz Tênb-toongh pha paiđ yaz taih, nzof yaz wâyc Nănh săngh ayx năngđ laix, six laiv lanh nhlinc yaz nyăngz a lauf wâyc yaz săngh ayx năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Nây six tăng guungh nzac taih nyăngz nzu, six max năngđ nyâuh nyăngz claof jex nhlinc nyăngz nzu, yâuc năngx zuc tayc. Laiv lanh nhlinc nâyx đomc nzu six tuz stâyv quâyx săngh.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Zâu Yê-su coong nâyx đomc wac wax zanyf six yămz wa Ca-bê-na-um dlanyh nyăngz huyđ toongh nzaox munh.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Tăng wa, naih đuungx lanh Nănh nyăngz stayb sây numđ nâyx đomc wac, stiz songđ coong: “Nâyx đomc wac senz zâuđ tuz nâyx, naih mănv hayh mungv tuz heh?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Six Zâu Yê-su pâyz tuz coong Nănh wax đomc stayb sây jinh đangh yônx nâyx đomc wac, Nănh songđ naic stiz coong: “Nâyx đomc wac ayx phunz nyâuh nyâyh longđ mah? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ha nâyx năngđ coong nyâuh phătc Bamh Munh muf cah đangc Nănh yămz nyăngz tinc bix laiv ayx laix heh? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Singx-Lingh six ayx phunz săngh wax Tauh; Stinb a six max setb luungđ tiny. Yaz coong nyăngz wac ănz nyâuh six Singx-Lingh cloon săngh mengc. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Six yămz nyâuh cah njaf naih lauh lanh lauf max zen.” Wâyc tăng coonz Zâu Yê-su cănh pâyz tuz laiv lanh six max zen, laiv lanh six maic Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Nănh songđ coong: “Six wâyc nâyx, yaz nzăngđ coong ănz nyâuh coong, năngđ coong max zâyf Tênb-toongh Pha sađ phunz, six max naih mănv hayh taih lov yaz.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Tăng wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây, naih đuungx lanh phunb đangz max lêpc Nănh ninyh gôh. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su naic wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây coong: “Hănđ nyâuh lauf oix phunb đangz mah?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Si-môn Pi-tê tauz Nănh coong: “Zâu lex, buz cayx ninyh lêpc mănv heh? Mâyh naih stâyv quâyx săngh mengc nyăngz wac, <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />buz zen yâuc pâyz tuz coong Mâyh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Đăngb Zeengh Munh.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Zâu Yê-su zef tauz stiz: “Max zâyf yaz sên nyâuh săpc nyâyc lanh taih nongc ayx stayb sây haz? Yămz nyâuh lâyc peob naih ah lanh six manđ.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Zâu Yê-su coong tauv Yu-đatc, Si-môn nyăngz toonz I-sa-ca-li-ôtx, wâyc nănh, six wa săpc nyâyc lanh nyăngz ah lanh stayb sây, cayx maic Zâu Yê-su.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Blătc wax đomc dlayc, Zâu Yê-su ninyh stunb wa Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, Nănh max hangb ninyh wa Yu-đê stâyz phangz, wâyc Yu-tai munh jinh đangh lov jau tayx Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Wax zanyf, six cayx tauv Yu-tai munh nyăngz ah nomz stêtz hipđ ayx, Njiuh Tamf stêtz. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc yâuf songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Oix zuc gâyh nâyx nomz tinc bix ninyh wa Yu-đê, phunz mâyh nyăngz stayb sây buz lauf tuz phătc mâyh ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Wâyc max naih mănv oix nongc munh pâyz nănh bix zef năngx pinyx ayx laiv huungđ. Năngđ coong tah senz hayh ayx tuz wax đomc cumh pâuz năngđ nâyx, oix zuc ayx phunz guungh đi munh tinyh đoih pâyz mâyh.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Wâyc njinh Zâu Yê-su wax đomc yâuf lauf max zen Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Yaz nyăngz săngx huđ max zeengx tauv, six nyâuh laiv zanyf săngx huđ ninyh lauf tuz. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Guungh đi munh max hayh hănđ nyâuh, six guungh đi munh hănđ yaz, wâyc yaz ayx zanyx manyf coong stiz ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz six huđ nzongf. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nyâuh phanv ninyh quaix stêtz gôh; yaz max zeengx ninyh quaix nâyx nomz stêtz wâyc yaz nyăngz săngx huđ max zeengx tauv.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Coong năngđ nâyx buz stiz tuz, Nănh lauf năngx yămz wa Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Six, tauv Nănh wax đomc yâuf ninyh quaix stêtz blătc, tăng wa Nănh lauf ninyh six max toongx songx ninyh, cungb pinyx ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Six tauv yămz wa stêtz, Yu-tai munh songđ lov Nănh, yâuc coong: “Wax tauh munh yămz laiv?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Yămz songx munh cah njaf naih đuungx lanh munh poc wa lănv Nănh. Manyf naih đuungx lanh munh coong: “Nănh six munh gongx.” Six lauf naih ah phanx munh coong: “Max zâyf đêh, nănh cungb ênz songx munh ninyh longđ lêc.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Six, yâuc max naih mănv nzađ toongx songx coong tauv Nănh, wâyc cumh nzav Yu-tai munh.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Tauv, yămz wa stêtz đamx cănv, Zâu Yê-su ninyh wa bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau nzaox gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Wax đomc Yu-tai munh numđ nyâyh ganc nzongf songđ coong: “Nâyx lanh munh max zeengx tuz hoođ đăngc quaix, ayx laix bix pâyz tuz lâyc đomc gâyf nâyx?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ tauz stiz coong: “Yaz nzaox nyăngz wac six max zâyf yaz nyăngz wac, six paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh nyăngz wac. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh oix ayx âyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz zux ix, wax lanh munh six saz tuz yaz nzaox nâyx đomc wac, six tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih, max six tăng yaz cănh coong setb taih. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Laiv lanh âyz cănh nyăngz nyâuđ coong, wax lanh six lov cănh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, six laiv lanh lov paiđ nănh taih wax Tauh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, wax lanh nzăngđ zâyf senz nyăngz, yâuc max naih cux quaiz nyăngz jau yămz wax lanh munh. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Max zâyf Mô-sê phunz gâyf njanh nyâuh haz? Six yămz nyâuh cah njaf max naih mănv âyz gâyf njanh ayx. Săngh laix nyâuh bix lov jau nongc tayx yaz?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Songx munh zef tauz: “Mâyh zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb nzof gôh! Mănv oix tayx mâyh heh?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Zâu Yê-su tauz, yâuc bux stiz coong: “Yaz ayx ah huungđ cumh pâuz, nyâuh yâuc muif lanh numđ nyâyh ganc nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Wâyc nâyx đomc dlayc, Mô-sê nzăngđ jaoz quaix catz nyăngz gâyf phunz nyâuh (wax cuyb gâyf six max zâyf tăng Mô-sê taih, six tăng wax đomc claof jex), nyâuh yâuc ayx quaix catz phunz munh toonz yămz tingc congz noib. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Năngđ coong ah lanh munh toonz yămz tingc congz noib, ayx quaix catz nyăngz gâyf nzăngđ max longđ Mô-sê nyăngz gâyf, ha săngh laix nyâuh bix nhlenx yaz, wâyc yaz yămz tingc congz noib zany phunz ah lanh munh tuz gongx? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Năngx gâyf cungb mangc cungh ngwaic stămđ, six oix zuc nongc peengh stimz nyăngz jau stămđ.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Wax zanyf, naih ah đomc Yê-lu-sa-lem munh coong: “Lâyc tauh munh max zâyf munh jinh đangh lov jau nongc tayx wax tauh haz? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Phanv mangc, nănh toongx songx dluyh stimz coong wac, lauf max naih mănv coong nănh. Naih dlih wax đomc ayx côx munh, lôx nyenc coong lâyc lanh munh six Zâu Jix-Tuz nzof stah? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Pănh pâyz nâyx lanh munh six tăng laiv tix taih. Six tauv Zâu Jix-Tuz taih, yâuc max naih mănv pâyz Nănh tăng laiv taih.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau nzaox gâyf yâuc hamv stingb lub coong: “Nyâuh pâyz yaz, yâuc pâyz yaz tăng laiv tix taih. Yaz max zâyf cănh taih, six paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh six senz nyăngz, six nyâuh yâuc max pâyz Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Yaz pâyz Nănh, wâyc yaz six tăng Nănh taih, nzof yaz six Nănh paiđ taih.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Tăng wa, stiz lov jau zoz Nănh, six max naih mănv setb puf zoz Nănh, wâyc Nănh nyăngz săngx huđ max zeengx tauv. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Six, wax đomc songx munh naih đuungx lanh zen Nănh, stiz songđ coong: “Tauv Zâu Jix-Tuz taih, max cayb Nănh lôx ayx jix caox njingc năngx đuungx têx nâyx lanh munh ayx nyăngz baz?” <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Pha-li-si munh numđ songx munh coong tauv Zâu Yê-su nâyx đomc wac, wax đomc stayb munh cloon Pha-li-si munh, songđ paiđ ah đomc peengz ninyh nongc zoz Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz năngx cloon nyâuh yămz tix cay ah dlapc timb, nzof yaz songđ muf paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh wa gôh. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nyâuh six lov yaz, six nyâuh lov max pongh, wâyc yaz yămz nyăngz tinc, nyâuh max hayh ninyh tuz tauv.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Năngđ nây, Yu-tai munh lanh naic lanh coong: “Lâyc lanh munh nănh cayx ninyh laiv tix pănh bix lov max pongh? Sangx nănh cayx ninyh lov wax đomc pec stingx yămz wa Hi-lapc wax đomc nzaox Hi-lapc munh lêc baz? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Nănh coong: ‘Nyâuh six lov yaz, six nyâuh lov max pongh, yaz yămz nyăngz tinc nyâuh six max hayh ninyh tuz tauv, nâyx zâux wac âyz gâyf six ayx laix’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Six tauv nzuf byăng wax noib, six năngx nongc sen têx, quaix stêtz nyăngz noib, Zâu Yê-su nyoongz quef hamv stingb lub coong: “Năngđ coong laiv lanh nyâuđ gatb, bix taih yaz nây hopb. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Laiv lanh zen yaz, six năngđ Canyx-stâub coong nâyx: ‘Săngh mengc nyăngz wăngx sting six tăng nănh nyăngz nyâuđ njâuc setb taih.’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Zâu Yê-su coong ayx nâyx six coong tauv Singx-Lingh, laiv lanh zen Nănh six tuz stipx wax Tauh, wax zanyf Singx-Lingh six max zeengx taih, wâyc Zâu Yê-su max zeengx tuz gwăngz eeng. <verse eid="JHN 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Songx munh numđ wax đomc wac, songđ naih ah phanx coong: “Lâyc lanh munh senz zâyf tâuc wac munh gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Naih ah phanx coong: “Nâyx lanh munh six Zâu Jix-Tuz.” Six ah phanx coong: “Ha Zâu Jix-Tuz bix tăng Ga-li-lê taih naz? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Max zâyf Canyx-stâub bux coong, Zâu Jix-Tuz six tăng Đa-witx wax stuungh munh setb, yâuc yămz Đa-witx wax tiuh njăngv Bêtx-le-hem taih haz?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Năngđ nâyx, wâyc Zâu Yê-su songx munh songđ phunz goib. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wax zanyf, yămz stiz wa naih ah phanx oix zoz Nănh, six max naih mănv setb puf zoz Nănh.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Blătc wa, wax đomc peengz phunb đangz lauf pongh wax đomc stayb munh cloon Pha-li-si munh, wax đomc munh naic stiz: “Săngh laix nyâuh bix max ênz nănh lauf?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wax đomc peengz tauz: “Max zeengx naih mănv nzaox gâyf năngđ nâyx lanh munh.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Tăng wa, wax đomc Pha-li-si munh zef coong ănz stiz: “Max cayb nyâuh lauf zuc nănh jaf nzof stah? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mangc jađ wax đomc ayx côx munh cloon wax đomc Pha-li-si munh naih mănv zen nănh geh? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Six, lâyc peob songx munh max pâyz tauv gâyf njanh tiny, nănh stiz senz jic tuz zuc zaux!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ni-cô-đê-matx (six cah đangc ninyh pongh Zâu Yê-su wax tauh, lauf stiz wax peob nyăngz ah lanh munh) coong ănz stiz: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Pănh nyăngz gâyf max phunz tingc mănv nyăngz stoif, năngđ coong pănh max zeengx tuz numđ tăng wax tauh munh yâuc max pâyz tuz wax tauh munh ayx nyăngz jau quaix đangc, zâyf max?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Stiz tauz, nănh coong: “Ha mâyh lauf Ga-li-lê munh yah? Oix zuc zah mangc, max naih laiv tauh tâuc wac munh tăng Ga-li-lê setb taih.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />[Nzof stiz songđ mănv muf mănv nyăngz pyau.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su staox Ca-lan zoongz ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Six tauv guungh gwăngz njâu, Zâu Yê-su zef ninyh wa bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau, munh tinyh đoih tinyh ênz taih Nănh wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc nzaox gâyf stênx steengb cloon wax đomc Pha-li-si munh, ênz ah lanh munh nzif taih wâyc nănh jinh đangh ayx pongz lauh nyăngz jau wax zanyf, bix zuc toopz, stiz songđ phunz wax tauh munh nzif stâuđ yămz wa mungh tongx. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Wâyc stâyv Zâu Yê-su, wax đomc stayb munh coong ănz Nănh phunz stiz nzăngđ naih wac cooux Nănh: “Stênx steengb lex, nâyx lanh munh nzif zuc toopz six wâyc nănh ayx pongz lauh nyăngz stoif. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Six, yămz gâyf njanh, Mô-sê bux êu zuc zoz njăuz ôx wax đomc munh năngđ nâyx, ha nâyx zanyf, mâyh coong ayx laix heh?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Six Zâu Yê-su cumf nzac, nongc Nănh nyăngz bah đoz ja wa nib. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Six wax zanyf, stiz njinh luh naic, Zâu Yê-su zaub minb mangc yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh đomc mănv max naih stoif, bix zoz njauz ôx nănh đangc geh.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Nănh cumf nzac, zef zoz Nănh nyăngz bah đoz ja wa nib. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Six, wax đomc Yu-tai munh săngh lanh săngh lanh têx muf, tăng wax đomc munh côx muf đangc, stiz muif lanh muf nzuf, cungb năngx naih Zâu Yê-su ah lanh yămz wa, cloon wax tauh munh nzif stâuđ yămz wa mungh tongx. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zaub minb mangc songđ coong ănz wax tauh munh nzif: “Nănh stiz quaix laiv ninyh nzuf nzof heh? Max naih mănv tingc mâyh nyăngz stoif haz?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Wax tauh munh nzif songđ tauz: “Zâu lex, max naih mănv tiny.” Zâu Yê-su zef coong: “Yaz lauf max tingc mâyh nyăngz stoif. Mâyh phanv muf gôh, tăng nây staox ninyh năngx gâyf pamf stoif gôh bex.”]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zef coong ănz songx munh coong: “Yaz six bamh canz nyăngz gwăngz, laiv lanh lêpc yaz six max yăngh nzămc nyăngz jau, six naih săngh mengc nyăngz gwăngz” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Blătc wa, naih ah đomc Pha-li-si munh coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz mâyh, mâyh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac six max săngh zen.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Zâu Yê-su tauz ănz stiz coong: “Yaz hănđ cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz, six yaz nyăngz zanyx manyf wac six senz nyăngz. Wâyc yaz pâyz yaz tăng laiv tix taih yaz yâuc pâyz yaz cayx ninyh laiv, six nyâuh max pâyz yaz tăng laiv tix taih yâuc max pâyz yaz cayx ninyh laiv. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nyâuh âyz bamh munh nyăngz zux ix stămđ; six Yaz max stămđ toix laiv lanh. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Six yaz năngđ coong stămđ têx, yaz stămđ nyăngz six toix senz gâyf, wâyc yaz max zâyf ah lanh yămz six Tênb-toongh Pha, paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh cloon yaz yămz. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Yămz nyâuh nyăngz gâyf njanh yâuc naih ja coong, iz lanh munh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac six săngh zen. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Yaz cănh ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz, nzof Tênb-toongh Pha paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh, yâuc ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, stiz coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh nyăngz Pha yămz laiv heh?” Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Nyâuh max pâyz yaz, yâuc max pâyz yaz nyăngz Pha; nyâuh năngđ coong pâyz yaz, nyâuh lauf pâyz yaz nyăngz Pha.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Nănh coong nâyx đomc wac six yămz wa pungx hoođ nyanh hoomh tinc, jinh đangh yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau nzaox gâyf wax zanyf, lauf max naih mănv zoz Nănh, wâyc Nănh nyăngz săngx huđ max zeengx tauv.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Tăng wa, Nănh zef coong ănz stiz: “Yaz ninyh, nyâuh six lov yaz, nzof nyâuh six zuc tayc yămz nyâuh nyăngz stoif. Yaz ninyh nyăngz tinc, nyâuh yâuc max hayh ninyh tuz tauv.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Six Yu-tai munh yâuc coong: “Săngx lâyc tauh munh nănh cayx cănh ninyh tayc lêc baz, wâyc nănh coong: ‘Yaz ninyh nyăngz tinc nyâuh max hayh ninyh tuz tauv’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh tăng cah đi taih, six yaz tăng cah zâyc taih. Nyâuh săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, six yaz max zâyf săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Wâyc nây, yaz bux nyâuh coong, nyâuh six tayc yămz nyâuh nyăngz stoif. Nyâuh năngđ coong max zen coong yaz six wax Tauh, nyâuh six tayc yămz nyâuh nyăngz stoif.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Tăng wa, stiz songđ naic Nănh coong: “Mâyh six mănv heh?” Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Wax huungđ six tăng ah yac yaz coong bux nyâuh nzof? <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Yaz naih đuungx huungđ nongc coong yâuc nongc stămđ nyâuh. Six, paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh six senz nyăngz; nzof yaz numđ Nănh coong laiv huungđ, yaz yâuc coong wax huungđ phunz bamh munh.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Wax đomc munh max saz coong, Zâu Yê-su jinh đangh coong tauv Tênb-toongh Pha ănz stiz. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz stiz: “Tauv nyâuh njăpc Bamh Munh staox njăngb wax zanyf, nyâuh songđ pâyz coong yaz six mănv, yaz max cănh ayx toix laiv huungđ. Six, yaz coong nâyx đomc wac six âyz Tênb-toongh pha nzaox yaz nyăngz wac. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh cloon yaz yămz; Nănh max quanyf yaz ah lanh yămz, wâyc yaz muif dlih ayx hoođ Nănh nyăngz nyâuđ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Zâu Yê-su jinh đangh nzaox nâyx đomc wac wax zanyf, naih munh đuungx zen Nănh.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Zâu Yê-su songđ coong ănz zen Nănh wax đomc Yu-tai munh coong: “Năngđ coong nyâuh muif dlih âyz yaz nyăngz wac ayx, nyâuh senz săngh yaz nyăngz stayb sây; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />nyâuh pâyz senz gâyf, senz gâyf six pungx goib nyâuh.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Stiz tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Buz six Apx-la-ham nyăngz sây stunz yâuc max zeengx ayx nâuh phunz toix laiv lanh; săngx laix mâyh bix coong: ‘Nyâuh six tuz pungx goib’?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh pamf stoif six ayx stoif nyăngz nâuh. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Six, ayx nâuh nyăngz munh max tuz stâyv quâyx yămz wa pyau, toonz nzăngđ tuz stâyv quâyx yămz. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Wâyc nây, năngđ coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz pungx goib nyâuh, nyâuh six senz tuz pungx goib. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Yaz pâyz coong nyâuh six Apx-la-ham nyăngz sây stunz, six nyâuh lov jau tayx yaz, wâyc nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ max naih yaz nyăngz wac ax tinyh. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Yaz coong nyăngz jau six yaz phătc yămz Tênb-toongh Pha wa; nzof nyâuh ayx nyăngz jau six nyâuh âyz nyâuh nyăngz pha ayx.” <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Stiz tauz ănz Nănh coong: “Buz nyăngz Pha six Apx-la-ham.” Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Năngđ coong nyâuh six Apx-la-ham nyăngz sây stunz, nyâuh six lauf ayx cayx năngđ Apx-la-ham nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Six nâyx zanyf, nyâuh lov jau tayx yaz, yaz six ah lanh munh numđ tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz senz gâyf, bix taih coong bux ănz nyâuh. Apx-la-ham six max ayx năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nyâuh six ayx nyâuh nyăngz pha nyăngz cumh pâuz.” Tăng wa, stiz coong ănz Nănh: “Buz steengb taih six max zâyf cungh ngwaic sây; buz cungb naih ah lanh Pha, six Zâu Tênb-Huungh.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Năngđ coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh six nyâuh nyăngz Pha, nyâuh six stăngz yaz, wâyc yaz tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih, yaz naih minb yămz nây; six max zâyf âyz yaz cănh nyăngz zux ix taih, six Nănh paiđ yaz taih. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Wâyc săngh laix nyâuh max saz yaz coong nyăngz wac? Six wâyc nyâuh max hayh mungv yaz nyăngz gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nyâuh nyăngz pha, six manđ huungh, nyâuh yâuc numđ nyađ ayx âyz nyâuh nyăngz pha nyăngz zux ix. Tăng coonz nănh six tayx munh nyăngz munh yâuc max hayh ayx âyz senz gâyf, wâyc yămz nănh six max naih senz gâyf. Nănh coong puv maoh six âyz nănh cănh nyăngz phăn coong, wâyc nănh six puv maoh nyăngz munh, yâuc ayx coong puv mauh nyăngz pha. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Six wâyc yaz coong senz, nyâuh nzăngđ max zen yaz. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Nyâuh naih mănv zah tuz yaz naih stoif heh? Năngđ coong yaz coong senz nyăngz, wâyc săngh laix nyâuh bix max zen yaz? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Laiv lanh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz munh cănh mungv Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz wac; wâyc nây nyâuh max mungv six wâyc nyâuh max zâyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz munh.” <verse eid="JHN 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yu-tai munh tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Buz coong mâyh six Sa-ma-đi munh zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb, max toix haz?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Yaz max zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb, six, yaz zanyb yaz nyăngz Pha, nyâuh yâuc pib mađ yaz. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Yaz max lov yaz cănh nyăngz gwăngz eeng; naih ah Tauh lov yâuc stămđ. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, năngđ coong laiv lanh âyz yaz nyăngz wac ayx, wax lanh six stâyv quâyx max tayc.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yu-tai munh coong ănz Nănh: “Nâyx zanyf buz songđ senz pâyz coong mâyh zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb gôh. Apx-la-ham cloon wax đomc tâuc wac munh tayc nzuf nzof, six mâyh coong: ‘Năngđ coong laiv lanh âyz yaz nyăngz wac ayx, wax lanh munh six stâyv quâyx max tayc.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ha mâyh bix năngx lub têx buz nyăngz claof jex Apx-la-ham naz, nănh tayc nzof? Wax đomc tâuc wac munh lauf tayc nzuf. Mâyh nyâyh mâyh six mănv heh?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Năngđ coong yaz cănh zanyb yaz, yaz nyăngz gwăngz eeng six max setb luungđ; zanyb yaz wax Tauh six yaz nyăngz Pha, nyâuh yâuc nhlimc wax Tauh coong Nănh six nyâuh nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nyâuh max pâyz Nănh, six yaz pâyz Nănh. Năngđ coong yaz coong: ‘Yaz max pâyz Nănh,’ yaz six lauf puv maoh munh cayx năngđ nyâuh nâyx. Six, yaz pâyz Nănh yâuc âyz Nănh nyăngz wac ayx. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Nyâuh nyăngz claof jex, Apx-la-ham numđ nyađ nyâyh mungc oix tuz phătc yaz nyăngz noib, nănh tuz phătc songđ numđ nyađ nzongf.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Six Yu-tai munh coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh max zeengx tuz ngâuf săpc nyăngv, mâyh bix tuz phătc Apx-la-ham nzof naz?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Zâu Yê-su zef tauz stiz coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, tăng Apx-la-ham max zeengx steengb stâyv, bix naih yaz nzof.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Wax zanyf, stiz lumz njauz nongc ôx Nănh, six Zâu Yê-su nimx nimx setb bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau ninyh.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Jinh đangh ninyh jau wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su phătc ah lanh munh tăng steengb stâyv taih bix mâyc buđ. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây naic Nănh coong: “La-bi lex, mănv ayx longđ stoif, nănh max six nănh nyăngz nzif pha, bix ayx phunz nănh tăng steengb taih bix mâyc buđ heh?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Max zâyf nănh, yâuc max zâyf nănh nyăngz nzif pha longđ stoif đêh, six wâyc phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cumh pâuz tuz ayx săngh yămz nănh setb taih. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Nây six năngx jinh bah noib zax, pănh six oix zuc ayx paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh nyăngz cumh pâuz. Tauv nzămc, six max naih mănv hayh ayx tuz cumh pâuz. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Yaz năngx jinh yămz nây bamh canz, yaz six bamh canz nyăngz gwăngz.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Coong nâyx đomc wac tuz, Nănh nzuv nzanh nzac nib ninyh, zoz nzanh womz nyuih pênx pamc, yâuc zoz wax cuib pamc hâuh ănz wax tauh mâyc buđ munh nyăngz mâyc. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Zâu Yê-su songđ bux nănh coong: “Phanv ninyh wa, Si-lô-am glangh đaox” (Si-lô-am âyz gâyf six “Tuz Paiđ Ninyh”). Tăng wa, nănh songđ ninyh đaox mâyc, songđ mangc tuz phătc, yâuc phunb đangz lauf. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Six, wax đomc njăngv njaf munh cloon cah đangc phătc nănh joođ nhlinc wax đomc munh, stiz coong: “Lâyc tauh munh max zâyf njinh leox stâyv wa joođ nhlinc wax tauh haz?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Naih ah phanx coong: “Zâyf nănh gôh.” Naih ah phanx zef coong: “Max zâyf đêh, six, wax tauh senz năngđ lâyc tauh.” Nănh yâuc njinh luh coong: “Zâyf yaz gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Tăng wa stiz naic nănh coong: “Ayx laix mâyh nyăngz mâyc bix mangc tuz phătc heh?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nănh tauz: “Naih ah lanh munh bux hipđ ayx Yê-su nyuih pamc hâuh ănz yaz nyăngz mâyc, yâuc bux yaz coong: ‘Phanv ninyh tauv wa Si-lô-am đaox.’ Tăng wa, ninyh đaox tuz, yaz bix mangc tuz phătc.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Stiz naic nănh coong: “Wax tauh munh yămz laiv heh?” Nănh tauz: “Yaz max pâyz.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Stiz ênz cah đangc mâyc buđ wax lanh munh, ninyh pongh wax đomc Pha-li-si munh. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />(Zâu Yê-su nyuih pamc coib nănh nyăngz mâyc wax noib six toix tingc congz noib.) <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Tăng wa, wax đomc Pha-li-si munh zef lauf naic nănh ayx laix mâyh bix mangc tuz phătc. Nănh songđ tauz stiz coong: “Wax tauh munh hâuh pamc ănz yaz nyăngz mâyc, yaz songđ ninyh đaox bix mangc tuz phătc.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Tăng wa, wax đomc Pha-li-si munh naih ah phanx coong: “Lâyc tauh munh max zâyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz munh, wâyc nănh max âyz tingc congz noib nyăngz gâyf ayx.” Naih ah phanx zef coong: “Ah lanh naih stoif nyăngz munh, laiv hayh ayx nâyx đomc jix caox njingc năngđ nâyx heh?” Tăng wa stiz songđ naih phunz goib. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Tăng wa stiz zef naic mâyc buđ munh ah hâyđ timb, coong: “Tăng nănh coib tuz mâyh nyăngz mâyc, mâyh coong nănh six mănv?” Tăng wa, nănh tauz coong: “Nănh six ah tauh tâuc wac munh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Six, Yu-tai munh max zen coong nănh cah đangc mâyc buđ, bix nâyx zanyf zef mangc tuz phătc, ayx tuz tauv stiz êu mâyc buđ munh nyăngz nzif pha taih. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Stiz naic nănh nyăngz nzif pha coong: “Nâyx tauh zâyf nyâuh nyăngz toonz max, nyâuh coong nănh tăng steengb taih bix mâyc buđ? Ha ayx laix nâyx zanyf nănh bix mangc tuz phătc?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Tăng wa nănh nyăngz nzif pha tauz ănz stiz coong: “Buz pâyz tuz coong nâyx tauh six senz buz nyăngz toonz, nănh tăng steengb taih bix mâyc buđ nzof. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Six nâyx zanyf, ayx laix nănh bix mangc tuz phătc, buz max pâyz, buz lauf max pâyz, mănv coib nănh nyăngz mâyc. Nănh lub nzof; phanv naic nănh. Nănh cănh coong phunz.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Nănh nyăngz nzif pha coong ayx năngđ nâyx six wâyc stiz cumh nzav Yu-tai munh. Wâyc Yu-tai munh coong, năngđ coong laiv lanh nhlimc Nănh six Zâu Jix-Tuz, wax tauh six zuc luiđ setb huyđ toongh ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, nănh nyăngz nzif pha nzăngđ coong: “Nănh lub nzof, phanv naic nănh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Stiz êu cah đangc mâyc buđ wax lanh munh taih tah nyâyc hâyđ yâuc bux nănh coong: “Oix zuc tanv Zâu Tênb-Huungh. Buz pâyz coong wax tauh munh six ah lanh stoif munh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Nănh songđ tauz coong: “Wax tauh munh naih stoif max naih, yaz max pâyz. Yaz cungb pâyz ah huungđ cuungv, wax huungđ six yaz mâyc bux, bix nâyx zanyf yaz mangc tuz phătc.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Blătc wa, stiz naic nănh coong: “Wax tauh munh ayx laix ănz mâyh heh? Nănh coib mâyh nyăngz mâyc ayx laix?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Nănh tauz stiz: “Yaz lănv bux nyâuh nzec, six nyâuh max mungv! Săngh laix nyâuh zef oix mungv timb heh? Ha nyâuh lauf oix săngh nănh nyăngz stayb sây mah?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Stiz songđ mađ nănh coong: “Mâyh six wax tauh ya nyăngz stayb sây gôh, buz six Mô-sê nyăngz stayb sây. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Buz pâyz coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh coong bux Mô-sê, six nâyx lanh munh, buz max pâyz nănh tăng laiv tix taih.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Wax tauh munh tauz ănz stiz coong: “Nây nzăngđ zâyf numđ njingc nef, nănh coib tuz yaz nyăngz mâyc nyâuh bix lauf max pâyz coong nănh tăng laiv tix taih. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Pănh pâyz tuz coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh six max mungv stoif munh nyăngz wac, six năngđ coong naih laiv lanh naih nyâuđ zanyb yâuc âyz nănh nyăngz âyx ayx, Nănh six mungv wax lanh. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Tăng lôx noib, max zeengx tuz numđ coong quaix, naih laiv lanh munh hayh zany tuz tăng steengb taih bix mâyc buđ nyăngz munh. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Năngđ coong nâyx lanh munh max zâyf tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih, nănh six max hayh ayx tuz laiv huungđ cumh pâuz.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Stiz tauz nănh coong: “Mâyh tăng steengb taih bix naih stoif mâyh bix zef năngx nzaox buz naz?” Tăng wa stiz songđ luiđ nănh setb ninyh.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Zâu Yê-su numđ coong stiz luiđ nănh setb cungh ngwaic ninyh Zâu Yê-su songđ ninyh lov pongh nănh, yâuc coong: “Mâyh zen Bamh Munh max?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Nănh songđ tauz coong: “Zâu lex, wax tauh munh six mănv heh, phunz yaz nzăngđ hayh zen nănh?” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh: “Mâyh tuz phătc nănh nzof, wax Tauh six nâyx zanyf cloon mâyh coong wac nây geh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Wax zanyf, nănh coong: “Zâu lex, yaz zen lêc,” nănh songđ quâyc nzac paix Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz nzac nâyx nomz bamh canz taih six wâyc stămđ stoif, phunz mâyc buđ nyăngz munh hayh mangc tuz phătc, zef mangc tuz phătc nyăngz munh yâuc pênx mâyc buđ munh.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Naih ah đomc Pha-li-si munh cloon Zâu Yê-su yămz wa, stiz numđ wax đomc wac, songđ naic Nănh: “Ha buz bix lauf mâyc buđ naz?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Năngđ coong nyâuh mâyc buđ nyâuh six max naih stoif, six nâyx zanyf nyâuh coong: ‘Buz mangc tuz phătc.’ Wâyc nây, nyâuh lauf năngx jinh naih stoif.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh max quaix jeengh nzac pax jiz yuungh gôh ninyh, bix lekb quaix pitc đoif nzac, wax tauh six ayx stac nimc nyăngz munh. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Six tăng jeengh nzac ninyh wax tauh nzăngđ zâyf jămđ pax jiz yuungh nyăngz munh. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Zu jeengh munh coib jeengh phunz nănh, pax jiz yuungh yâuc mungv jămđ nyăngz munh nyăngz stingb, nzof jămđ nyăngz munh yâuc âyz nănh nyăngz pax jiz yuungh nyăngz bux saox songđ ênz stiz setb cungh ngwaic ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Tauv jămđ nyăngz munh ênz nănh nyăngz pax jiz yuungh setb taih nzuf, nănh ninyh đangc stiz, pax jiz yuungh six lêpc nănh đangz ninyh, wâyc pax jiz yuungh saz tuz nănh nyăngz stingb. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Pax jiz yuungh six senz max ninyh lêpc munh njingc, stiz songđ lov jau tiuv, wâyc stiz max saz tuz munh njingc nyăngz stingb.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Zâu Yê-su coong nâyx đomc wac pây ănz stiz, six stiz max saz tuz Nănh coong laiv luungđ ănz stiz.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zef coong ănz stiz: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh yaz six pax jiz yuungh nyăngz jeengh. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Taih đangc yaz wax đomc muif lanh munh six ayx stac nimc nyăngz munh six pax jiz yuungh yâuc max mungv nănh stiz. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Yaz six jeengh. Năngđ coong laiv lanh quaix yaz nzac ninyh, wax tauh munh six tuz njâuv, nzof wax lanh six tuz nzac ninyh, nzac lauf yâuc lov tuz pongh mađ meengz đungc. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Stac munh six max taih năngđ coong max zâyf nongc nimc, tayx, mêtc. Yaz taih six phunz pax jiz yuungh tuz naih săngh mengc yâuc tuz clăkx clunh nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Yaz six jămđ pax jiz yuungh gongx nyăngz munh. Jămđ pax jiz yuungh gongx nyăngz munh cănh nyunc sađ nănh nyăngz mengc wâyc pax jiz yuungh. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Câux jămđ nyăngz munh, wâyc zuc max zâyf jămđ nyăngz munh, pax jiz yuungh lauf max zâyf nănh nyăngz, nănh phătc njaf clô taih songđ quanyf pax jiz yuungh tiuv, njaf clô songđ zoomf zoz pax jiz yuungh yâuc ayx phunz đanv nzuf, <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />wâyc nănh six cungb câux jămđ nyăngz munh, nănh six max numđ stauh tauv pax jiz yuungh. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Yaz six jămđ gongx nyăngz munh, yaz saz yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh, nzof yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh yâuc saz yaz, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />năngđ Tênb-toongh Pha pâyz yaz, yaz lauf pâyz Tênb-toongh Pha; yaz songđ nyunc sađ yaz nyăngz mengc wâyc pax jiz yuungh. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Yaz năngx naih ah đomc pax jiz yuungh six max yămz nâyx nomz gôh. Yaz zuc ênz stiz lauf, stiz six mungv yaz nyăngz stingb, songđ săngh ah peob cuungv, cloon ah lanh munh jămđ cuungv. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Wâyc nây, Tênb-toongh Pha stăngz yaz, six wâyc yaz sađ yaz nyăngz mengc tayc, phunz yaz hayh tuz mengc lauf. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Max naih mănv zoz yaz nyăngz mengc ninyh gâyh yaz, six wâyc, yaz cănh nyunc sađ yaz nyăngz mengc tayc. Yaz naih gâyf sađ yaz cănh nyăngz mengc, yaz yâuc naih gâyf zoz mengc lauf. Yaz tuz stipx nâyx đomc lanyf six tăng yaz nyăngz Pha taih.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Wâyc wax đomc wac, wax đomc Yu-tai munh songđ naih phunz goib. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Wax zanyf, yămz nănh stiz wa naih đuungx lanh munh coong: “Lâyc tauh munh zuc manđ nzac yămz stinb yâuc max sting. Săngh laix nyâuh bix năngx mungv nănh heh?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Naih ah phanx coong: “Nâyx đomc wac max zâyf munh zuc manđ yămz stinb nyăngz wac. Ha manđ bix hayh coib mâyc buđ munh nyăngz mâyc naz?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Wax zanyf yămz wa Yê-lu-sa-lem naih Nzac Bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh Nyăngz Săngb Pyau Stêtz. Wax zanyf six toix guungh song, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Zâu Yê-su yăngh wa bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau, yămz Sa-lô-môn nyăngz tungh sec tinc. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Tăng wa, wax đomc Yu-tai munh quib nzêuh Nănh nzuf, stiz yâuc coong ănz Nănh: “Mâyh cayx ayx phunz buz nyăngz nyâuđ lunc tauv laiv zanyf heh? Năngđ coong mâyh six Zâu Jix-Tuz, oix zuc toongx songx coong zac bux buz.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Yaz bux ănz nyâuh nzof six nyâuh yâuc max zen. Yaz yămz yaz nyăngz Pha nyăngz manyh ayx wax đomc cumh pâuz, wax đomc cumh pâuz six ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Nyâuh max zen six wâyc nyâuh max zâyf yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh cănh mungv yaz nyăngz stingb, six yaz lauf pâyz nănh stiz, nănh stiz yâuc lêpc yaz. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Yaz yâuc sađ phunz nănh stiz naih stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, nănh stiz six stâyv quâyx max zuc tayc, yâuc max naih mănv hayh nimc tuz wax đomc pax jiz yuungh gâyh yaz nyăngz puf ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Yaz nyăngz Pha, six jaoz nănh stiz phunz yaz wax Tauh, Nănh six năngx lub quaix muif huungđ, yâuc max naih mănv hayh nimc tuz nănh stiz gâyh Pha nyăngz puf. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Yaz căn Pha six ah tauh.” <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Wax đomc Yu-tai munh zef zoz njauz cayx ôx Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Yaz tăng Pha ayx đuungx huungđ cumh pâuz gongx phunz nyâuh phătc. Nyâuh wâyc yaz ayx nyăngz laiv huungđ cumh pâuz bix cayx ôx yaz heh?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wax đomc Yu-tai munh tauz Nănh: “Buz ôx mâyh max zâyf wâyc laiv huungđ cumh pâuz gongx, six wâyc pamf nyăngz stoif, yâuc wâyc mâyh, six ah lanh bamh munh, bix cănh nhlimc coong mâyh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Yămz nyâuh nyăngz gâyf njanh, max zâyf naih wac ja coong: ‘Yaz coong: “Nyâuh six stinz”’ nâyx haz? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Năngđ coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh hipđ, tuz Nănh nyăngz wac coong tauv wax đomc munh, six stinz (nzof Canyx Stâub yâuc max coi wănc), <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />ha săngh laix nyâuh coong ănz Zâu Tênb-Huungh cănh lanyc paiđ nzac bamh canz taih wax Tauh coong: ‘Mâyh coong pamf,’ wâyc yaz coong: ‘Yaz six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Năngđ coong yaz max ayx yaz nyăngz Pha nyăngz cumh pâuz, six năngx gâyf zen yaz. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Six năngđ coong yaz jinh đangh ayx, nyâuh hănđ max zen yaz, yâuc oix zuc zen wax đomc cumh pâuz, phunz nyâuh hayh pâyz yâuc saz tuz coong Tênb-toongh Pha yămz yaz cah njaf, yaz yâuc yămz Tênb-toongh Pha cah njaf.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Wâyc nây, stiz zef lov jau zoz Zâu Yê-su, six Nănh tiuv gâyh stiz nyăngz puf đi.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Zâu Yê-su zef phunb đangz muf wax nganđ leepb Njoh-đen wăngx, muf tauv cah đangc Yô-hanx ayx quaix-gâyf wax cuyb tinc Nănh songđ yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Naih munh đuungx taih pongh Nănh, stiz songđ coong: “Yô-hanx manyf max ayx laiv huungđ jix caox njingc, six Yô-hanx coong tauv nâyx lanh munh nyăngz jau senz toix nzongf.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Yămz wa yâuc, naih munh đuungx zen Zâu Yê-su.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Wax zanyf, naih ah lanh munh săngh gumc, bux hipđ ayx La-sa-latx yămz Bê-ta-ni njăngv, six Ma-li-ya cloon nănh nyăngz ô Ma-ta yămz wax tiuh njăngv. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Ma-li-ya six hâuh yâuh đangz phunz Zâu zef nongc nănh nyăngz pyây đongz stotb Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staux wax tauh, nănh nyăngz nauf six La-sa-latx jinh đangh săngh gumc. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Tăng wa, stiz iz ô stayx êu munh stăngc pungx wac ninyh tauv Zâu Yê-su coong: “Zâu lex, phanv mangc, Mâyh stăngz wax tauh jinh đangh săngh gumc.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Zâu Yê-su numđ nâyx đomc wac, songđ coong: “Nâyx tauh gumc six max tayc tuz đêh, six, wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, yâuc phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz păngc nây tuz munh zanyb.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />(Zâu Yê-su hâuđ lênh Ma-ta, nănh nyăngz stayx, cloon La-sa-latx nzongf.) <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Wâyc nâyx, Zâu Yê-su numđ coong La-sa-latx jinh đangh săngh gumc, Nănh zef năngx yămz nănh wax cuib tinc iz noib timb. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz wax đomc stayb sây: “Pănh oix zuc phunb đangz muf wa Yu-đê stâyz phangz timb.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Stayb sây buz tauz Nănh coong: “La-bi lex, nâyx zanyf Yu-tai munh jinh đangh lov mâyh ôx, săngh laix mâyh bix zef năngx phunb đangz muf wa heh?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Bah noib zax max zâyf naih săpc nyâyc săngx huđ haz? Năngđ coong laiv lanh bah noib zax yăngh jau wax lanh six max glinyf, wâyc nănh phătc nâyx nomz bamh canz nyăngz gwăngz. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Six năngđ coong laiv lanh njinh nzămc yăngh jau, wax lanh six glinyf, wâyc max naih gwăngz siux nănh.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Nănh coong ayx nâyx, tuz, Nănh zef bux stiz: “La-sa-latx, pănh nyăngz lah pyeoz toic, phâyx mâyc njoomh nzof, six yaz ninyh nongc êu nănh điub.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Tăng wa, stayb sây buz tauz Nănh: “Zâu lex, năngđ coong nănh mâyc njoomh, nănh six cănh gongx.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />(Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su six coong tauv La-sa-latx tayc, six stayb sây buz nyâyh coong Nănh coong tauv phâyx mâyc njoomh hitb conv.) <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong zac bux stiz: “La-sa-latx tayc nzof. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Yaz numđ nyađ wâyc phunz nyâuh tuz gongx, wâyc yaz max naih minb yămz wa, phunz nyâuh nzăngđ hayh zen. Six, pănh oix zuc ninyh tauv nănh wa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tăng wa, Tô-matx, yâuc hipđ ayx Sây Toix, coong ănz lêpc Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây: “Pănh lauf hoopđ zuc ninyh phunz pănh nzăngđ hayh cloon Nănh songc tayc.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Tăng wa, ninyh tauv tinc wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su phătc La-sa-latx zuc plopx ănz wa stâu pyâyz noib nzof. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bê-ta-ni njăngv yămz gâyh Yê-lu-sa-lem, cox pôz gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Wax đomc Yu-tai munh naih munh đuungx taih Ma-ta cloon Ma-li-ya wa nongc oonz stiz iz ô stayx nyăngz nyâuđ wâyc stiz nyăngz nauf tayc. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Tăng wa, Ma-ta numđ coong Zâu Yê-su taih, nănh songđ ninyh stipx Zâu Yê-su, six Ma-li-ya stâyv yămz wa pyau. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Wax zanyf, Ma-ta coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Zâu lex, năngđ coong Mâyh yămz nây, yaz nyăngz nauf six max tayc. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Six, nâyx zanyf, yaz pâyz tuz coong Mâyh joođ Zâu Tênb-Huungh toix laiv huungđ, Zâu Tênb-Huungh six sađ phunz Mâyh.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Mâyh nyăngz nauf six tuz săngh taih.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Ma-ta tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz pâyz tuz coong tauv stêtb mâyv noib, songx munh tuz săngh taih wax zanyf, yaz nyăngz nauf six lauf tuz săngh taih.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Zâu Yê-su coong bux nănh: “Yaz six săngh taih nyăngz săngh mengc; laiv lanh zen yaz, nănh hănđ tayc lauf tuz săngh; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />laiv lanh năngx săngh bix zen yaz wax lanh six stâyv quâyx max hayh tayc. Mâyh zen nâyx đomc max?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Nănh tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Zâu lex, yaz zen lêc, yaz zen coong Mâyh six Zâu Jix-Tuz, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz, yâuc zuc taih yămz nây bamh canz wax Tauh.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Coong năngđ nâyx tuz, nănh phunb đangz muf lanyc êu Ma-li-ya, nănh nyăngz stayx, coong: “Stayb pha yămz nây nzof Nănh êu mâyh.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ma-li-ya numđ coong năngđ nâyx, nănh songđ coonx nyoongz quef ninyh Zâu Yê-su wa. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su max zeengx nzac njăngv lauf năngx jinh yămz Ma-ta pongh Nănh wax cuib tinc. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc Yu-tai munh, six cloon nănh yămz wa pyau oonz nănh nyăngz nyâuđ wax đomc, phătc Ma-li-ya coonx nyoongz quef setb cungh ngwaic ninyh, songđ lêpc nănh ninyh, nyâyh coong nănh ninyh wa stâu haoh. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Tăng wa, Ma-li-ya ninyh tauv Zâu Yê-su yămf nyăngz tinc, ah phătc Zâu Yê-su wax zanyf, nănh songđ quâyc nzac Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staux ninyh, coong ănz Nănh: “Zâu lex, Mâyh năngđ coong yămz nây, yaz nyăngz nauf six max tayc.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su phătc nănh haoh, hănđ lêpc nănh ninyh wax đomc Yu-tai munh lauf haoh, Zâu Yê-su senz numđ munz tauv Nănh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Zâu Yê-su naic: “Nyâuh plopx nănh ănz laiv tix heh?” Stiz tauz Nănh coong: “Zâu lex, joođ ninyh mangc.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Zâu Yê-su haoh. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Wâyc nâyx, wax đomc Yu-tai munh coong: “Phanv mangc, nănh stăngz lâyc tauh munh tuz nâyx!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Six yămz stiz naih ah phanx coong: “Lâyc tauh munh, six coib mâyc buđ munh nyăngz mâyc wax tauh, lauf max hayh ayx laix tuz phunz nâyx tauh munh max tayc haz?” <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zef numđ munz stimz, ninyh tauv wa stâu waz zanyf. Wax nomz stâu six ah nomz njauz ngamh, yâuc naih ah nomz njauz pyây zetx wa ngamh nzetx. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Zâu Yê-su êu coong: “Stuyđ lâyc nomz njăuz pyây ayx queengx gôh.” Ma-ta, munh tayc nyăngz ô, coong ănz Nănh: “Zâu lex, nănh stâyx nzof, wâyc tuz pyâyz noib nâyx noib nzof.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Yaz max zâyf bux mâyh coong năngđ coong mâyh zen, mâyh six tuz phătc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz gwăngz eeng nâyx haz?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Tăng wa, stiz songđ stuyđ njăuz pyây ayx queengx. Nzof Zâu Yê-su songđ ngoongv minb staox guungh ninyh yâuc coong: “Pha lex, yaz hâuđ Pha wâyc Mâyh mungv yaz nyăngz wac. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Six yaz pâyz tuz coong Pha muif dlih mungv yaz, yaz coong năngđ nâyx six wâyc stâuđ quib nây nyăngz munh, phunz stiz zen coong Pha paiđ yaz taih.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Coong năngđ nâyx tuz, Nănh hamv stingb lub coong: “La-sa-latx lex, setb cungh ngwaic taih gôh!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Munh tayc songđ setb taih, puf cloon staux lauf năngx zuc buyx sênh, six nănh nyăngz minb lauf năngx jinh zuc buyx pêuz. Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Ninyh stăngc zay nănh phunz nănh muf.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Năngđ nâyx, wax peob Yu-tai munh naih munh đuungx, six taih tex Ma-li-ya wax đomc munh stiz phătc Zâu Yê-su ayx nyăngz dlayc, songđ zen Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Six stiz wax peob naih ah phanx ninyh pongh Pha-li-si munh yâuc lănv Zâu Yê-su ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz bux stiz.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Wâyc nây, wax đomc stayb munh cloon Pha-li-si munh êu Ayx Côx Nyăngz Yu-tai Munh taih căpx dlonf sangv gwangh, yâuc coong: “Pănh cayx ayx laix heh, wâyc nâyx tauh munh ayx jix caox njingc đuungx yongb? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Năngđ coong pănh dluyh nănh ayx năngđ nâyx, munh muif lanh six zen nănh nzuf, nzof Lô-ma munh six taih zab njinh nâyx tungđ jêmh cloon pănh nyăngz côkz.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Six, stiz wax peob naih ah lanh munh, bux hipđ ayx, Ca-ya-phatx, wax nyăngv toix nănh ayx stayb munh pyây, coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh senz max pâyz luungđ tiny stăngv. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Nyâuh max nyâyh tauv coong nođ phunz ah lanh munh tayc tayv phunz songx munh, six năngx gongx têx, njinh pec stingx zuc stutc nzuf haz?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Wax zanyf, nănh coong wax đomc wac six max zâyf nănh cănh coong, six wâyc nănh ayx stayb munh pyây wax nyăngv, nănh bix tâuc wac coong Zâu Yê-su six zuc tayc wâyc pec stingx, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />six max zâyf cungb wâyc nâyx stingx cuungv, six năngx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz toonz sab zuc ninyh đanv wax đomc taih săngh ah peob. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Năngđ nâyx, tăng wax noib, stiz songđ lov jau ta zux ayx laix tuz phunz Nănh zuc tayc.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su max toongx songx setb ninyh setb lauf yămz Yu-tai munh nyăngz mungh toongx nzof, six Nănh gâyh wax cuyb tinc huungv ninyh ah nomz stâyz phangz stătx wa stâyz phangz blănf, naih ah nomz dlanyh hipđ ayx Ê-pha-im. Nănh cloon stayb sây buz yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Wax zanyf, cayx tauv Yu-tai munh nyăngz Pyenv Mengc Stêtz, max zeengx tauv Pyenv Mengc Stêtz, naih munh đuungx tăng đuungx đoif njăngv ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem quaix đangc nongc stav cănh nyăngz wâyx. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Tăng wa, stiz lov Zâu Yê-su, yâuc stâuđ yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau lanh naic lanh coong: “Âyz nyâuh nyâyh, six ayx laix? Ha Nănh senz max taih quaix stêtz haz?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc stayb munh cloon Pha-li-si munh setb lanyf coong, năngđ coong laiv lanh pâyz Nănh yămz laiv tix, wax lanh munh six zuc bux stiz, phunz stiz nzăngđ hayh zoz Nănh.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Joz noib cah đangc, cayx tauv Pyenv Mengc Stêtz, Zâu Yê-su ninyh tauv wa Bê-ta-ni njăngv, La-sa-latx yămz nyăngz tinc, nâyx tauh munh six Zâu Yê-su ayx phunz tăng tayc săngh taih wax tauh. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Tăng wa stiz songđ tinyđ Nănh bah nzămc năngv yămz wa, Ma-ta six bokc dlic, năngx naih La-sa-latx six ah lanh cloon Zâu Yê-su stâyv wa hinh nhlinc năngv nyăngz munh. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Wax zanyf, Ma-li-ya zoz ah sanz senz nyăngz na-đa yâuh đangz saix nzongf taih, njămh ănz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staux, yâuc nongc nănh nyăngz đongz stotb Zâu Yê-su nyăngz staux. Wax zanyf, wax đomc yâuh songđ đangz pong wax sênz pyau nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Six Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây naih ah lanh hipđ ayx Yu-đa I-sa-ca-li-ôtx, tauv blătc maic Zâu Yê-su wax tauh, coong: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Săngh laix bix max nzâyz nâyx zaih yâuh đangz ninyh maic wănc stamx pez noib congz nyanh, nongc stăngc phunz munh zâuđ munh?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />(Wax zanyf, nănh coong năngđ nâyx six max zâyf wâyc nănh hâuđ lênh tauv munh zâuđ munh, wâyc nănh six ayx stac munh, nzauf nyanh tic wax zanyf, nănh nimc pungx ănz wa tic wax đomc nyanh.) <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su coong: “Phanv dluyh nănh, wâyc nănh njâuh nâyx đomc yâuh six nongc phunz tauv plopx yaz wax noib. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Wâyc nyâuh muif dlih naih munh zâuđ cloon nyâuh yămz, six nyâuh max zâyf stâyv quâyx naih yaz.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Tăng wa, wax đomc Yu-tai munh naih ah peob hongđ nzongf pâyz tuz coong Zâu Yê-su năngx jinh yămz wa, stiz songđ tinyh ênz taih, max zâyf cungb wâyc Zâu Yê-su cuungv, six stiz lauf oix mangc tuz phătc La-sa-latx, six Zâu Yê-su ayx phunz tăng tayc săngh taih wax tauh. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Six wax đomc stayb munh ta zux ix, ayx laix phunz stiz hayh njinh tayx cloon La-sa-latx; <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />wâyc zuc tăng La-sa-latx, bix naih đuungx lanh Yu-tai munh quanyf stiz bix zen Zâu Yê-su.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Tah nyâyc noib, naih songx munh hongđ nzongf, six taih quaix stêtz wax đomc munh, numđ coong Zâu Yê-su jinh đangh ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />stiz songđ zoz wax đomc goc noomh, bix setb ninyh nongc stipx Zâu Yê-su yâuc hamv lub coong: “Hô-sa-na! Poou phunz yămz Zâu nyăngz manyh taih wax Tauh, six I-sa-la-ên munh nyăngz Huungh!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su lov tuz ah tauh maf li jenz, songđ zâyh nănh, cayx năngđ naih wac ja coong:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Si-ôn nyăngz munh sab lex, năngx gâyf cumh nzav.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Phanv mangc, mâyh nyăngz Huungh jinh đangh, zâyh maf li jenz taih.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ah yađ, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây max saz tuz nâyx đomc jau, six tauv Zâu Yê-su tuz gwăngz eeng, stiz nzăngđ săngx tauv coong, naih wax đomc wac tuz ja tauv Zâu Yê-su, nzof munh yâuc ayx săngh năngđ nâyx phunz Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Blătc wa, naih munh đuungx ayx zanyx manyf phunz Nănh, stiz six naih minb yămz toix Zâu Yê-su êu La-sa-latx setb stâu taih yâuc ayx phunz nănh tăng tayc săngh taih wax zanyf, nyăngz munh. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, songx munh ninyh stipx Zâu Yê-su, wâyc stiz numđ coong Zâu Yê-su ayx nâyx huungđ jix caox njingc. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Wâyc nây, Pha-li-si munh lanh coong ănz lanh: “Nyâuh phătc max, nyâuh ayx max setb luungđ tiny stăngv? Phanv mangc geh, guungh đi munh ninyh lêpc nănh nzuf nzof.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc munh ninyh wa stêtz nongc canyx bongc, naih ah phanx six Hi-lapc munh. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Tăng wa, nâyx đomc munh ninyh lov yămz, Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, Bêtx-sai-đa dlanyh wax tauh Phi-lipx, yâuc coong: “Tah lex, buz oix pongh Zâu Yê-su.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Phi-lipx songđ ninyh bux An-đa-lu; An-đa-lu songđ cloon Phi-lipx ninyh coong ănz Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz, coong: “Săngx huđ phunz Bamh Munh tuz gwăngz eeng tauv nzof. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, năngđ coong blauh witx zub, songx nzac nib ninyh, max yootz têx, nănh six cungb ah nomz cuungv; six năngđ coong nănh yootz, nănh six săngh tuz đuungx. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Laiv lanh zâuh cănh nyăngz mengc six zuc stâyb mengc; six laiv lanh quanyf nănh cănh nyăngz mengc yămz nâyx stâyv six tuz nănh nyăngz mengc tauv stâyv quâyx. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Năngđ coong laiv tauh bokc dlic yaz, wax tauh six zuc lêpc yaz; yaz yămz laiv, bokc dlic yaz nyăngz munh lauf yămz wa. Năngđ coong laiv tauh bokc dlic yaz, yaz nyăngz Pha six zanyb wax tauh. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Nâyx zanyf, yaz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ numđ mungh huungđ nzuf, yaz cayx coong laix? ‘Pha lex, joođ njâuv yaz blătc nâyx săngx huđ?’ Six lauf, wâyc wax huungđ cumh pâuz nâyx zanyf yaz bix taih nây. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Pha lex, joođ Pha nyăngz manyh tuz gwăngz eeng.” Tăng wa, naih ah stingb tăng guungh taih coong: “Yaz tuz gwăngz eeng nzof six Yaz ayx phunz năngx gwăngz eeng têx timb.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Wax zanyf, naih munh hongđ stâuđ wa cah sinh yâuc mungv numđ, stiz coong nzăngđ ah yađ naih bah congz haoh. Naih ah phanx coong: “Naih ah lanh stinz munh cloon nănh coong wac.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Zâu Yê-su tauz coong “Nâyx đomc stingb buib max zâyf wâyc yaz, six wâyc nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Nâyx yenh six nâyx nomz bamh canz zuc stămđ: Nâyx zanyf, cun nây bamh canz wax tauh six zuc quanyf setb cungh ngwaic ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Năngx naih yaz, yaz laiv zanyf zuc pâuh gâyh nây nib, yaz six đănx munh tinyh đoih taih cloon yaz.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Wax zanyf, Nănh coong nâyx đomc wac, six coong si tauv nănh cayx zuc tayc ayx năngđ laix. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Tăng wa songx munh tauz Nănh coong: “Buz numđ gâyf njanh naih coong Zâu Jix-Tuz six stâyv quâyx săngh. Ha săngh laix mâyh bix coong: ‘Bamh munh six zuc pâuh staox njăngb’? Mănv six wax tauh Bamh Munh heh?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Gwăngz năngx năngx jinh cloon nyâuh yămz tix cay ah dlapc timb. Nyâuh năngx jinh naih gwăngz nyăngz săngx huđ oix zuc yăngh ninyh gôh, phunz nzămc nzăngđ max hayh zoz nyâuh. Njinh nzămc yăngh nyăngz munh max pâyz tuz nănh ninyh laiv tix. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Nyâuh naih gwăngz nyăngz săngx huđ, oix zuc zen gwăngz phunz nyâuh săngh gwăngz nyăngz toonz sab.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Zâu Yê-su coong nâyx đomc wac tuz songđ setb ninyh, Nănh pyenv gâyh stiz. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Zâu Yê-su hănđ yămz stiz nyăngz cah đangc ayx đuungx huungđ jix caox njingc, six stiz lauf max zen Nănh, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />phunz tâuc wac munh I-sa-ya, coong nyăngz wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Zâu lex, Mănv zen buz nzaox nyăngz wac,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">nzof Zâu nyăngz puf tuz coib phunz mănv heh?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, stiz nzăngđ max hayh zen, wâyc I-sa-ya zeb coong timb:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Mâyh ayx phunz stiz mâyc buđ, Mâyh yâuc ayx phunz stiz nyăngz nyâuđ nhlengc;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">sangx stiz nyăngz mâyc hayh mangc tuz phătc, nyâuđ yâuc hayh manyh pec,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">songđ phunb đangz lauf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Yaz yâuc zany phunz stiz tuz gongx.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />I-sa-ya nzaox nâyx đomc wac six wâyc nănh tuz phătc Zâu Yê-su nyăngz gwăngz eeng songđ coong tauv Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Six, manyf naih đuungx lanh ayx côx nyăngz munh zen Zâu Yê-su, six wâyc cumh nzav wax đomc Pha-li-si munh, stiz songđ max nzađ toongx songx nhlimc, wangb stiz zuc luiđ setb huyđ toongh. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Wâyc stiz oix nongc munh tanv năngx nzongf têx, Zâu Tênb-Huungh tanv.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su hamv stingb lub coong: “Laiv lanh zen yaz max zâyf cungb zen yaz cuungv, six lauf zen paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh, <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />laiv lanh phătc yaz six lauf phătc paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Yaz taih ayx bamh canz nyăngz gwăngz, phunz laiv lanh zen yaz six max zuc yămz nzămc cah njaf. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh mungv yaz nyăngz wac bix max âyz ayx, yaz lauf max stămđ wax tauh; wâyc yaz taih max zâyf nongc stămđ bamh munh six nongc njâuv bamh munh. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Laiv lanh nzêmh yaz, max mungv yaz nyăngz wac six naih ah Tauh stămđ wax lanh munh. Yaz coong nâyx đomc wac tauv stêtb mâyv wax noib six cănh stămđ wax lanh munh. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Wâyc max zâyf yaz cănh coong, six paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh Tênb-toongh Pha, cănh jaoz lanyf phunz yaz, yaz oix zuc nzaox luungđ, yaz oix zuc coong laiv huungđ. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Six yaz pâyz coong Nănh nyăngz lanyf, six stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc. Wâyc nây, yaz coong nyăngz wac, six Pha bux yaz năngđ laix, yaz lauf coong năngđ wa nâyx.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Wax zanyf, cayx tauv Pyenv Mengc Stêtz, Zâu Yê-su pâyz tuz coong Nănh gâyh nâyx nomz bamh canz muf Tênb-toongh Pha wa nyăngz săngx huđ tauv nzof. Nănh songđ numđ stăngz yămz bamh canz zen Nănh nyăngz munh, Nănh six stăngz stiz tauv tauh tauv mâyv. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Jinh đangh nhlinc bah nzămc năngv, manđ songđ njôx ănz Yu-đatc I-sa-ca-li-ôtx, Si-môn nyăngz toonz nyăngz nyâuđ, phunz nănh maic Zâu Yê-su, <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Wâyc pâyz coong Tênb-toongh Pha jaoz muif huungđ yămz Nănh nyăngz puf, yâuc pâyz coong Nănh tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih, yâuc cayx phunb đangz muf Zâu Tênb-Huungh wa, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Nănh songđ nyoongz quef gâyh wa hinh, zay cungh ngwaic yămc guyz. Nănh yâuc zoz tungh minb đao taih, sênh ănz Nănh nyăngz clai. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Tăng wa, Nănh taox womz ănz nzac tungh bônh ninyh songđ đaox staux phunz stayb sây buz, yâuc zoz stayb Nănh nyăngz clai wax nomz tungh minb nongc stotb gaib. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Nzof, Zâu Yê-su ninyh tauv Si-môn Pi-tê. Pi-tê songđ coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Zâu lex, Mâyh đaox staux phunz yaz naz?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Zâu Yê-su tauz ănz nănh coong: “Mâyh max tuz yaz nâyx zanyf ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz, six tauv blătc nây, mâyh cănh pâyz.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pi-tê tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Yaz six bâyf max phunz Mâyh đaox yaz nyăngz staux.” Zâu Yê-su zef tauz nănh coong: “Năngđ coong yaz max đaox phunz mâyh, mâyh six max naih luungđ phănc cloon yaz tiny.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Si-môn Pi-tê tauz Nănh coong: “Zâu lex, max zâyf cungb đaox yaz nyăngz staux cuungv, six đaox njinh puf cloon yaz nyăngz pyây timb.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Laiv lanh tuz đapc stinb six max zuc ayx nâyx, cungb zuc đaox staux cuungv, wax lanh munh six tuz dlăngc nzuf, six max zâyf nyâuh muif lanh tuz dlăngc.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />(Wâyc Zâu Yê-su pâyz coong mănv maic Nănh, wâyc năngđ nây Nănh nzăngđ coong: “Nyâuh max zâyf muif lanh tuz dlăngc.”)<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su đaox staux phunz stayb sây buz tuz, Nănh songđ zoz cungh ngwaic wax yămc guyz zuz, yâuc stâyv nzac, songđ coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh pâyz tuz yaz ah yac ayx luungđ phunz nyâuh max? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Nyâuh hipđ yaz ayx ‘Stayb pha’, yâuc hipđ ayx ‘Zâu’; nyâuh coong senz toix nzongf wâyc yaz senz năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Wâyc nây, năngđ coong yaz, six ayx Zâu, yâuc ayx Stayb pha, bix năngx đaox staux phunz nyâuh, nyâuh six lauf zuc lanh đaox staux phunz lanh. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Wâyc yaz ayx gao phunz nyâuh mangc, phunz nyâuh lauf ayx cayx năngđ yaz ayx phunz nyâuh nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, pâuz six max năngx lub têx nănh nyăngz zâu; paiđ ninyh nyăngz munh lauf max năngx lub têx paiđ nănh ninyh wax tauh. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Năngđ coong nyâuh pâyz nâyx đomc jau, nyâuh yâuc ayx âyz, nyâuh six tuz pôz. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Yaz max zâyf coong tauv nyâuh muif lanh nzuf; yaz pâyz yaz sên taih nyăngz munh — six phunz Canyx Stâub nyăngz wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf, coong: ‘Cloon yaz nhlinc nzu nyăngz munh nănh zaub staux tămx yaz.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Tăng nâyx zanyf, dlayc max zeengx setb yaz bux nyâuh quaix đangc, tauv dlayc setb taih wax zanyf, nyâuh nzăngđ zen coong yaz six Stâyv Quâyx Săngh. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh stipx yaz paiđ ninyh nyăngz munh six lauf stipx yaz, nzof laiv lanh stipx yaz six lauf stipx paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Coong nâyx đomc wac tuz, Zâu Yê-su numđ stauh stimz, Nănh songđ coong: “Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, nyâuh lâyc đomc naih ah lanh six maic yaz.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Stayb sây buz lanh mangc lanh, max pâyz Nănh coong mănv. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây naih ah lanh, six Zâu Yê-su stăngz wax lanh, stâyv yămz wa hinh cah sinh, pongc Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah lapc. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Tăng wa, Si-môn Pi-tê songđ tăng hih ănz wax lanh êu naic mangc jađ, “Stayb pha coong wax tauh six mănv?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, wax lanh munh songđ nzaz stinb pongc Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah lapc, songđ naic Nănh: “Zâu lex, wax lanh six mănv heh?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Wax tauh six yaz nokx nâyx ah nzu tuz, bix clôc phunz wax tauh.” Tăng wa, Nănh nokx wax ah nzu tuz, songđ clôc phunz Yu-đatc, Si-môn nyăngz toonz I-sa-ca-li-ôtx. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Blătc wax ax nzu, Sax-tanx songđ nzac yămz nănh nyăngz stinb. Wâyc nây, Zâu Yê-su bux nănh coong: “Mâyh oix ayx luungđ, bix ayx zef gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />(Six, stâyv wa hinh nyăngz munh max naih mănv pâyz tuz wâyc săngh laix Zâu Yê-su bix coong ănz nănh năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Wâyc naih ah phanx six nyâyh coong, Yu-đatc nzauf nyanh tic, Zâu Yê-su bix bux nănh: “Êu ninyh maif tax huungđ lauf nongc quaix stêtz,” max six nzâyz tix huungđ ninyh phunz munh zâuđ munh.) <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Tăng wa, Yu-đatc nhlinc wax ax nzu tuz, songđ lênh dlih setb ninyh. Wax zanyf, lauf nzămc nzof.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Năngđ nâyx, tauv Yu-đatc ninyh blătc Zâu Yê-su songđ coong: “Nâyx zanyf, Bamh Munh tuz gwăngz eeng nzof, Zâu Tênb-Huungh lauf tuz gwăngz eeng yămz Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh six ayx phunz Bamh Munh tuz gwăngz eeng yămz Nănh, Nănh songđ coonx ayx phunz Bamh munh tuz gwăngz eeng. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Sây jenz lex, yaz năngx cloon nyâuh yămz tix cay timb lêc. Nyâuh six lov yaz, lauf năngđ yaz coong ănz wax đomc Yu-tai munh nâyx, coong: ‘Yaz ninyh nyăngz tinc, nyâuh max hayh ninyh tuz tauv.’ Nâyx zanyf, yaz lauf coong năngđ nâyx ănz nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Yaz jaoz phunz nyâuh ah huungđ săngb lanyf, nyâuh six zuc lanh stăngz lanh; yaz stăngz nyâuh năngđ laix, nyâuh lauf zuc lanh stăngz lanh năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Năngđ coong nyâuh lanh stăngz lanh, wâyc nâyx, muif lanh munh six saz tuz coong nyâuh six yaz nyăngz stayb sây.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Si-môn Pi-tê coong ănz Nănh: “Zâu lex, Mâyh ninyh laiv heh?” Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh: “Yaz ninyh nyăngz tinc, nâyx zanyf mâyh max zeengx hayh lêpc yaz tuz, blătc nây, mâyh six lêpc ninyh.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pi-tê songđ coong ănz Nănh: “Zâu lex, wâyc săngh laix yaz nâyx zanyf bix max hayh lêpc Mâyh tuz heh? Yaz six nyunc tayc yaz nyăngz mengc wâyc Mâyh.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Mâyh nyunc tayc mâyh nyăngz mengc wâyc yaz naz? Yaz coong senz bux mâyh, zayz coongh max ayx caix, mâyh six pyenv yaz pôz hâyđ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Nyâuh năngx gâyf nyâuđ wangb. Nyâuh oix zuc zen caođ Zâu Tênb-Huungh, yâuc oix zuc zen caođ yaz. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Yaz nyăngz Pha nyăngz pyau naih tinc yămz đuungx. Năngđ coong max naih, yaz lauf bux nyâuh nzof gôh, wâyc yaz muf bênc ah cuib tinc phunz nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Tauv yaz muf bênc ah cuib tinc phunz nyâuh tuz, yaz six năngx phunb đangz taih ênz nyâuh muf lêpc yaz, phunz yaz yămz laiv nyâuh lauf yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Yaz ninyh nyăngz tinc nyâuh lauf pâyz jau ninyh nzof.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tô-matx naic Nănh coong: “Zâu lex, buz max pâyz tuz mâyh cayx ninyh laiv, buz laiv hayh pâyz jau ninyh heh?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Yaz six ayx jau, yâuc ayx senz gâyf cloon săngh mengc; năngđ coong max păngc yaz six max naih mănv hayh ninyh tuz tauv Tênb-toongh Pha. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Năngđ coong nyâuh pâyz yaz, nyâuh six lauf pâyz yaz nyăngz Pha. Tăng nây, nyâuh pâyz tuz Nănh yâuc tuz phătc quaix Nănh.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Phi-lipx coong ănz Nănh: “Zâu lex, joođ phunz buz phătc Tênb-toongh Pha bex, năngđ nâyx buz songđ numđ caux gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Yaz cloon nyâuh yămz lauh tuz nâyx nzof, mâyh bix lauf max pâyz yaz naz, Phi-lipx? Laiv lanh phătc yaz six lauf phătc Tênb-toongh Pha. Săngh laix mâyh bix coong: ‘Joođ phunz buz phătc Tênb-toongh Pha heh’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Mâyh max zen coong yaz yămz Tênb-toongh Pha cah njaf, Tênb-toongh Pha lauf yămz yaz cah njaf haz? Yaz coong nâyx đomc wac ănz nyâuh max zâyf yaz cănh coong setb taih, six Tênb-toongh Pha muif dlih yămz yaz cah njaf ayx Nănh nyăngz cumh pâuz. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Oix zuc zen yaz coong, yaz yămz Tênb-toongh Pha cah njaf, Tênb-toongh Pha lauf yămz yaz cah njaf; Năngđ max têx, six oix zuc mangc yaz ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz zen. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, laiv lanh zen yaz, wax lanh six lauf ayx, yaz ayx wax đomc cumh pâuz, nzof zef ayx wax đomc cumh pâuz năngx lub têx timb, wâyc yaz cayx muf Tênb-toongh Pha wa. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Tinyh phanv nyâuh tim yaz nyăngz bux joođ laiv huungđ, yaz six ayx wax huungđ phunz, Phunz Tênb-toongh Pha wâyc Nănh nyăngz Toonz tuz munh tanv. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Năngđ coong nyâuh tim yaz nyăngz bux joođ laiv huungđ, yaz six ayx wax huungđ phunz. <verse eid="JHN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Năngđ coong nyâuh stăngz yaz, nyâuh six âyz yaz nyăngz lanyf ayx, <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />yaz six lauf joođ Tênb-toongh Pha, Nănh six sađ pitc Tauh taih oonz nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ, Nănh cloon nyâuh yămz tuz tauv stâyv quâyx, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />wax Tauh six Senz Gâyf nyăngz Singx-Lingh, bamh munh six max hayh stipx tuz Nănh, wâyc bamh munh max saz tuz Nănh, yâuc max pâyz Nănh. Nyâuh six pâyz Nănh, wâyc Nănh muif dlih cloon nyâuh yămz yâuc yămz nyâuh cah njaf. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Yaz six max quanyf nyâuh pênx cux hoonh sây đêh; Yaz six taih cloon nyâuh yămz. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Max naih lauh, bamh munh six max phătc yaz; six nyâuh lauf tuz phătc yaz, wâyc yaz săngh, nyâuh lauf tuz săngh. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Tauv wax noib, nyâuh six pâyz tuz coong yaz yămz yaz nyăngz Pha cah njaf, nyâuh lauf yămz yaz cah njaf, yaz lauf yămz nyâuh cah njaf. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Laiv lanh stipx yaz nyăngz lanyf yâuc âyz ayx, wax lanh six stăngz yaz nyăngz munh; nzof laiv lanh stăngz yaz six tuz yaz nyăngz Pha stăngz nănh; yaz lauf stăngz wax lanh yâuc phunz nănh pâyz yaz.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yu-đatc (Max zâyf I-sa-ca-li-ôtx) coong ănz Nănh: “Zâu lex, naih laiv luungđ dlayc setb, bix cayx phunz buz pâyz Mâyh yâuc max phunz bamh munh pâyz heh?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Zâu Yê-su tauz ănz nănh coong: “Năngđ coong laiv lanh stăngz yaz, wax lanh six âyz yaz nyăngz wac ayx. Yaz nyăngz Pha yâuc stăngz wax lanh munh; Buz songđ taih cloon wax lanh munh yămz, yâuc yămz wax lanh munh cah njaf. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Laiv tauh max stăngz yaz six max âyz yaz nyăngz wac ayx. Nyâuh mungv numđ nyăngz wac six max zâyf yaz nyăngz, six Tênb-toongh Pha nyăngz, paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Yaz năngx jinh cloon nyâuh yămz nyăngz săngx huđ, yaz coong nâyx đomc dlayc bux nyâuh nzuf nzof. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Six Oonz Nyâuđ Wax Tauh — six Zâu Singx-Lingh senz Pha tim yaz nyăngz bux paiđ taih — wax Tauh six cănh nzaox muif huungđ phunz nyâuh yâuc bux phunz nyâuh săngx yaz coong ănz nyâuh wax đomc wac. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Yaz njâuh peengh oonz phunz nyâuh; Yaz sađ yaz nyăngz peengh oonz phunz nyâuh, yaz phunz nyâuh nyăngz peengh oonz six max năngđ bamh canz phunz. Nyâuh năngx gâyf nyâuđ wangb, yâuc năngx gâyf cumh nzav. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Nyâuh tuz numđ yaz bux ănz nyâuh coong: ‘Yaz setb ninyh blătc, yaz zef năngx taih lov nyâuh.’ Năngđ coong nyâuh stăngz yaz, nyâuh six numđ nyađ yaz ninyh Pha wa, wâyc Pha six năngx lub têx yaz. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nâyx zanyf, nâyx đomc dlayc max zeengx setb yaz coong phunz nyâuh quaix đangc, zu tauv dlayc setb taih nyâuh nzăngđ zen. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Yaz max coong luungđ phunz nyâuh nzof, wâyc cun nây bamh canz wax tauh jinh đangh taih. Nănh six max naih luungđ lokc jangx cun yaz, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Six wâyc phunz bamh munh pâyz tuz coong yaz stăngz Tênb-toongh Pha, nzof Tênb-toongh Pha nzaox phunz yaz năngđ laix, yaz yâuc âyz ayx năngđ wa. Nyoongz quef, pănh ninyh gâyh nây gôh.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Yaz six senz tungh cuđ mâyb, yaz nyăngz Pha six songx tungh cuđ nyăngz munh. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Laiv stinz quah blaz yaz bix max săngh pyâu, Nănh six pătb ayx queengx; nzof laiv stinz quah săngh pyâu, Nănh six tiuz zany wax stinz quah phunz nănh hayh săngh pyâu năngx nyăuh têx. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Nyâuh tuz dlăngc nzof wâyc păngc yaz nzaox nyâuh nyăngz wac. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Phanv săngh yămz yaz, yaz songđ săngh yămz nyâuh. Cănh tungh cuđ quah max hayh săngh tuz pyâu năngđ coong nănh max săngh pyaz tungh cuđ mâyb, lauf tinyh năngđ, nyâuh max cănh hayh săngh tuz pyâu năngđ coong nyâuh max săngh yămz yaz. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Yaz six tungh cuđ mâyb coonz, nyâuh six quah. Laiv lanh săngh pyaz yaz, yaz songđ săngh plaz nănh, wax lanh six săngh pyâu nyăuh, năngđ coong gâyh goib yaz, nyâuh max hayh ayx tuz setb laiv huungđ. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh max săngh yămz yaz, wax lanh six zuc quanyf ayx queengx, cayx năngđ tungh cuđ quah caođ nâyx, munh ston nzâyz taih songđ quanyf nzac tâuf ninyh, stiz songđ zuc tâuf pu nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Năngđ coong nyâuh săngh yămz yaz, yaz nyăngz wac yâuc săngh yămz nyâuh, nyâuh oix nongc laiv luungđ phanv joođ, nyâuh six tuz wax huungđ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Yaz nyăngz Pha tuz munh zanyb, six wâyc nyâuh săngh pyâu nyăuh, yâuc wâyc nyâuh săngh yaz nyăngz stayb sây. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Tênb-toongh Pha stăngz yaz ayx laix, yaz lauf stăngz nyâuh năngđ wa nâyx. Oix zuc yămz yaz nyăngz stăngz cah njaf. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Năngđ coong nyâuh âyz yaz nyăngz lanyf ayx, nyâuh six oix zuc yămz yaz nyăngz stăngz cah njaf, năngđ yaz âyz yaz nyăngz Pha nyăngz lanyf ayx yâuc yămz Nănh nyăngz stăngz cah njaf nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Yaz coong nâyx đomc dlayc bux nyâuh, phunz nyâuh hayh tuz yaz nyăngz gwanb looc, nyâuh nyăngz gwanb looc yâuc tuz clăkx clunh nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Nây six yaz nyăngz lanyf, nyâuh oix zuc lanh stăngz lanh năngđ yaz stăngz nyâuh nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Max naih laiv huungđ stăngz năngx lub têx nây — six ah lanh munh nyunc tayc cănh nyăngz mengc wâyc nănh nyăngz lah pyeoz toic. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Năngđ coong nyâuh âyz yaz nzaox phunz nyâuh nâyx đomc wac ayx, nyâuh six săngh yaz nyăngz lah pyeoz toic. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Yaz max hipđ nyâuh ayx pâuz nzof, wâyc pâuz six max pâyz tuz nănh nyăngz zâu ayx luungđ cumh pâuz. Six yaz hipđ nyâuh ayx lah pyeoz toic, wâyc yaz numđ yaz nyăngz Pha coong nyăngz muif huungđ, yaz yâuc bux phunz nyâuh pâyz nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Max zâyf nyâuh sên yaz, six yaz sên nyâuh taih, yâuc njăpc nyâuh phunz nyâuh ninyh, săngh pyâu, nzof nyâuh nyăngz pyâu six tuz stâyv quâyx yămz, nyâuh tim yaz nyăngz bux joođ Tênb-toongh Pha toix laiv huungđ, Nănh six sađ phunz nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Yaz nzaox nâyx đomc wac bux nyâuh, six phunz nyâuh hayh lanh stăngz lanh. <verse eid="JHN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Năngđ coong bamh munh hănđ nyâuh, six oix zuc pâyz coong bamh munh hănđ yaz đangc nyâuh nzof. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Năngđ coong nyâuh săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, bamh munh six cănh stăngz săngh stiz nyăngz munh wax đomc. Six wâyc nyâuh max zâyf săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, wâyc, yaz sên nyâuh tăng bamh canz setb taih, wâyc nâyx bamh munh songđ hănđ nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Nyâuh oix zuc săngx yaz bux nyâuh nyăngz wac: ‘Pâuz six max năngx lub têx nănh nyăngz zâu.’ Năngđ coong stiz ayx huđ ănz yaz, stiz lauf ayx huđ ănz nyâuh; năngđ coong stiz âyz yaz nyăngz wac ayx, stiz lauf âyz nyâuh nyăngz wac ayx. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Six wâyc yaz nyăngz manyh, stiz six ayx wax đomc muif huungđ dlayc ănz nyâuh, wâyc stiz max pâyz paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Năngđ coong yaz max taih nzaox phunz stiz têx, stiz six max naih stoif, six nâyx zanyf, stiz max naih jau pyenv stiz nyăngz stoif gôh. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Laiv tauh hănđ yaz six lauf hănđ yaz nyăngz Pha. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Năngđ coong yaz max yămz stiz nyăngz mungh tongx ayx, max zeengx naih mănv hayh ayx tuz nyăngz cumh pâuz, stiz six max naih stoif, six wâyc nâyx zanyf stiz tuz phătc nzof, zef năngx hănđ yaz cloon yaz nyăngz Pha. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Six, wâyc phunz ja yămz stiz nyăngz gâyf njanh stâub wax đomc wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf coong: ‘Stiz hănđ yaz six max naih coonz tay.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Tauv Oonz Nyâuđ Wax Tauh taih, six yaz paiđ tăng Tênb-toongh Pha taih wax Tauh phunz nyâuh — six Senz Gâyf wax Tauh Singx-Lingh tăng Tênb-toongh Pha taih — Nănh six ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Six nyâuh lauf ayx zanyx manyf phunz yaz timb, wâyc nyâuh tăng coonz cloon yaz yămz.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Yaz coong nâyx đomc jau bux nyâuh, phunz nyâuh nzăngđ max zuc tuih nyâuđ. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Stiz six luiđ nyâuh setb huyđ toongh ninyh. Six tauv wax zanyf muif lanh tayx nyâuh nyăngz munh six laic nyâyh coong, stiz ayx nongc stungx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Stiz ayx wax đomc cumh pâuz six wâyc stiz max pâyz Tênb-toongh Pha, yâuc max pâyz yaz. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Six, yaz coong nâyx đomc jau bux phunz nyâuh nzof, phunz laiv zanyf beengc stiz nyăngz săngx huđ, nyâuh six săngx tauv yaz nzaox phunz nyâuh nâyx đomc wac. Six, tăng ah yac yaz max zeengx coong nâyx đomc jau phunz nyâuh, wâyc yaz năngx jinh cloon nyâuh yămz. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Six nâyx zanyf yaz muf paiđ yaz taih wax Tauh wa, nyâuh yâuc max naih mănv naic yaz coong: ‘Mâyh ninyh laiv tix heh?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Six wâyc yaz coong nâyx đomc jau bux nyâuh, nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ songđ numđ stauh nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Six, yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, yaz muf six wâyc phunz nyâuh tuz gongx. Năngđ coong yaz max muf, Oonz Nyâuđ Wax Tauh six max taih cloon nyâuh yămz. Six yaz năngđ coong muf, yaz six paiđ wax Tauh taih cloon nyâuh yămz. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Tauv wax Tauh taih Nănh six pob manyf phunz bamh munh pâyz tauv stoif, pâyz tauv ayx peengh stimz nyăngz jau, yâuc pâyz tauv tingc stoif nyăngz jau — <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />pâyz tauv stoif nyăngz jau, wâyc stiz max zen yaz; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />pâyz tauv ayx hoopđ nyăngz jau, six wâyc yaz muf yaz nyăngz Pha wa, nyâuh songđ max phătc yaz gôh; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />pâyz tauv stămđ stoif nyăngz jau, six wâyc cun nây bamh canz wax tauh zuc tingc stoif nzof. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Yaz naih đuungx huungđ dlayc timb bux nyâuh, six nâyx zanyf nyâuh max zeengx hayh saz tuz. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Six tauv wax Tauh senz gâyf nyăngz Singx-Lingh taih, Nănh six yenv nyâuh pâyz tuz muif huungđ senz gâyf, wâyc Nănh six max cănh coong, Nănh six cungb coong Nănh tuz numđ quaix nyăngz wac, Nănh yâuc bux phunz nyâuh pâyz tauv cayx zuc setb taih nyăngz jau. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Wax Tauh six zanyf yaz, wâyc Nănh stipx laiv huungđ tăng yaz taih Nănh yâuc bux phunz nyâuh pâyz. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Tênb-toongh Pha naih nyăngz muif huungđ, six săngh yaz nyăngz. Wâyc nâyx, yaz songđ coong, wax Tauh six stipx săngh yaz nyăngz wax đomc bux phunz nyâuh pâyz. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Max naih lauh, nyâuh six max tuz phătc yaz gôh, nzof blătc wa max lauh, nyâuh six zef tuz phătc yaz.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Wax zanyf, Nănh wax đomc stayb sây naih ah phanx poc wa lanh naic lanh coong: “Stayb pha coong ănz pănh coong: ‘Max naih lauh, nyâuh six max phătc yaz gôh, nzof blătc wa max lauh, nyâuh six zef tuz phătc yaz’ yâuc coong: ‘Wâyc yaz muf Tênb-toongh Pha wa’ Nâyx đomc dlayc six ayx laix?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Tăng wa, stiz coong: “‘Max lauh’ âyz gâyf six ayx laix loz? Pănh max pâyz stayb pha jinh đangh coong luungđ.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Zâu Yê-su pâyz coong stiz oix naic Nănh, Nănh songđ coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh cănh poc lâyc nyâyh tauv yaz coong wax đomc wac coong: ‘Max naih lauh, nyâuh max phătc yaz gôh, nzof blătc wa max lauh, nyâuh six zef tuz phătc yaz’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, nyâuh six yônx meengc, haoh, năngx naih bamh munh six numđ nyađ. Nyâuh yâuc numđ stauh, six nyâuh stauh nyăngz yâuc tuz coi pênx numđ nyađ. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Munh nzif beengc săngx huđ steengb sây wax zanyf six naih gumc munz njitc, six tauv steengb tuz ah lanh sây, nănh max săngx tauv nănh wax đomc munz, wâyc nănh numđ nyađ steengb tuz ah lanh sây yămz nây bamh canz. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Lauf tinyh năngđ, nâyx zanyf nyâuh six naih stauh nyăngz jau, six tauv yaz năngx pongh nyâuh timb, nzof nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ six tuz numđ nyađ, yâuc max naih mănv hayh zoz tuz nyâuh nyăngz numđ nyađ gâyh nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Tauv wax noib nyâuh six max naic yaz laiv huungđ. Yaz coong senz bux nyâuh, nyâuh tim yaz nyăngz manyh joođ Tênb-toongh Pha toix laiv huungđ, Nănh six sađ phunz nyâuh. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Tauv nâyx zanyf nyâuh lauf max zeengx tim yaz nyăngz manyh joođ laiv huungđ. Phanv joođ geh, nyâuh six stipx tuz, phunz nyâuh nyăngz numđ nyađ tuz clăkx clunh nzuf.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Yaz nongc wac pây coong nâyx đomc jau ănz nyâuh; săngx huđ tauv, yaz six max nongc wac pây coong ănz nyâuh nzof, plănc taih, yaz six coong năngx yox phunz nyâuh pâyz tauv Tênb-toongh Pha. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Tauv wax noib, nyâuh six tim yaz nyăngz manyh joođ, yaz yâuc max coong ănz nyâuh coong yaz six joođ Tênb-toongh Pha tayv phunz nyâuh, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />wâyc Tênb-toongh Pha cănh stăngz nyâuh, wâyc nyâuh stăngz yaz yâuc zen coong yaz six tăng Tênb-toongh Pha taih. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Yaz six tăng Tênb-toongh Pha wa nzac bamh canz taih. Nzof yaz zef gâyh bamh canz muf Tênb-toongh Pha wa.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Nănh wax đomc stayb sây coong: “Phanv mangc, stayb pha nâyx zanyf coong yox nzuf, yâuc max nongc wac pây coong. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nâyx zanyf, buz pâyz coong stayb pha pâyz muif huungđ nzuf, yâuc max sămv zuc mănv naic mâyh. Năngđ nâyx, buz zen coong mâyh six tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Zâu Yê-su tauz stiz coong: “Nâyx zanyf nyâuh zen max? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Phanv mangc, săngx huđ tauv — yâuc tauv nzof — nyâuh six zuc lunc nzuf, mănv ninyh mănv nyăngz jau, nyâuh quanyf yaz ah lanh yămz. Six, yaz max zâyf ah lanh yămz, wâyc Tênb-toongh Pha cloon yaz yămz. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Yaz coong nâyx đomc dlayc bux nyâuh phunz nyâuh naih gwanb looc yămz yaz. Nyâuh pongh zâuđ nanc yămz nây bamh canz, six oix zuc pungx nyâuđ, Yaz hingh quaix bamh canz nzof gôh.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Zâu Yê-su coong nâyx đomc wac tuz songđ zaub minb staox guungh ninyh, yâuc coong: “Pha lex, săngx huđ tauv nzof. Joođ phunz Mâyh nyăngz Toonz tuz gwăngz eeng, Phunz Toonz lauf hayh ayx phunz Pha tuz gwăngz eeng, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />wâyc Pha phunz Yaz naih lokc jangx cun muif lanh munh, Pha jaoz laiv lanh munh phunz Yaz, Yaz six sađ phunz wax đomc munh tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc, six phunz laiv lanh munh pâyz Pha wax đomc, six senz nyăngz ah tauh Zâu Tênb-Huungh, cloon Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, six Pha paiđ taih wax Tauh. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Yaz yămz nây bamh canz ayx phunz Pha tuz gwăngz eeng, yâuc ayx săngh nzuf Pha jaoz phunz Yaz ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Pha lex, nâyx zanyf joođ Pha ayx phunz Yaz tuz gwăngz eeng yămz Pha nyăngz cah đangc, cayx năngđ tăng max zeengx naih nây bamh canz, yaz bix naih gwăngz eeng yămz Pha nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Pha jaoz phunz Yaz yămz nây bamh canz wax đomc munh Yaz yâuc phunz stiz pâyz Pha nyăngz manyh. Stiz six săngh Pha nyăngz, Pha jaoz stiz phunz Yaz, stiz yâuc ayx âyz Pha nyăngz wac. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Nâyx zanyf, stiz pâyz tuz coong yetx stong muif huungđ Pha sađ phunz Yaz wax đomc, six tăng Pha taih, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />wâyc Pha sađ wax đomc wac phunz Yaz, Yaz yâuc sađ phunz stiz, stiz stipx wax đomc wac yâuc senz pâyz tuz coong Yaz tăng Pha taih, stiz yâuc zen coong Pha cănh paiđ Yaz taih. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Yaz joođ phunz stiz. Yaz max joođ phunz bamh canz munh, six phunz Pha jaoz phunz Yaz wax đomc munh, wâyc stiz săngh Pha nyăngz. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Yaz nyăngz muif huungđ six Pha nyăngz; lauf năngđ Pha nyăngz six Yaz nyăngz nâyx, Yaz yâuc wâyc stiz tuz gwăngz eeng. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Yaz max yămz nây bamh canz nzof, six stiz năngx jinh yămz nây bamh canz, Yaz six muf Pha wa. Đăngb Zeengh nyăngz Pha lex, joođ pêuz stiz yămz Pha nyăngz manyh cah njaf, six Pha sađ phunz Yaz nyăngz manyh, phunz stiz hayh songc ah tiuh nyâuđ, cayx năngđ Pănh nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Yaz năngx jinh cloon stiz yămz nyăngz săngx huđ, Yaz jămđ stiz yămz Pha nyăngz manyh, six Pha sađ phunz Yaz nyăngz manyh. Yaz jămđ stiz, yămz stiz songđ max naih mănv zuc gaih, blătc nzuf zuc mêtc wax tauh sây, phunz Canyx Stâub nyăngz wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Six nâyx zanyf, Yaz muf Pha wa, Yaz năngx jinh yămz nây bamh canz, yaz coong nâyx đomc wac, phunz stiz nyăngz nyâuđ naih Yaz nyăngz numđ nyađ clăkx clunh nzuf. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Yaz jaoz Pha nyăngz wac phunz stiz nzof, bamh munh songđ hănđ stiz wâyc stiz max săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, lauf năngđ Yaz max săngh bamh canz nyăngz nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Yaz max joođ Pha ênz stiz setb nây bamh canz, six joođ Pha pêuz omz stiz tuz gâyh đutb munh huđ. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Stiz max săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, lauf cayx năngđ yaz max săngh nâyx bamh canz nyăngz nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Joođ Pha nongc senz gâyf stav nănh stiz đăngb zeengh taih; Mâyh nyăngz wac six senz gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Pha paiđ Yaz yămz nây bamh canz ayx năngđ laix, six Yaz lauf paiđ stiz yămz nây bamh canz ayx năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Wâyc stiz Yaz cănh yămz ayx đăngb zeengh, phunz stiz lauf tuz đăngb zeengh yămz senz gâyf. <verse eid="JHN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Yaz six max zâyf cungb joođ phunz nâyx đomc munh cuungv, six lauf năngx phunz cloon laiv lanh mungv stiz nzônh nyăngz wac bix zen Yaz wax đomc munh timb, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />phunz stiz tinyh đoih songc ah tiuh nyâuđ, năngđ Pha yămz Yaz cah njaf, Yaz lauf yămz Pha cah njaf nâyx, yâuc phunz stiz yămz Pănh cah njaf, phunz bamh munh zen coong Pha paiđ Yaz taih. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Pha sađ phunz Yaz nyăngz gwăngz eeng, Yaz lauf sađ phunz stiz, phunz stiz hayh songc ah tiuh nyâuđ, năngđ Pănh songc ah tiuh nyâuđ nâyx; <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Yaz yămz stiz cah njaf, Pha yâuc yămz Yaz cah njaf, phunz stiz tuz clăkx clunh songc ah tiuh nyâuđ, phunz bamh munh pâyz tuz coong Pha paiđ Yaz taih, Pha yâuc stăngz stiz cayx năngđ Pha stăngz Yaz nâyx. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Pha lex, Mâyh jaoz laiv lanh phunz Yaz, Yaz oix Yaz yămz laiv stiz lauf tuz cloon Yaz yămz wa, phunz stiz tuz phătc Yaz nyăngz gwăngz eeng, six Pha sađ phunz Yaz nyăngz gwăngz eeng, wâyc tăng max zeengx zuyx guungh zuyx nib Pha bix stăngz Yaz nzof. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Peengh stimz nyăngz Pha lex, bamh munh manyf max pâyz Pha, six Yaz pâyz Pha; nâyx đomc munh yâuc pâyz tuz coong Pha paiđ Yaz taih. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Yaz phunz stiz pâyz tuz Pha nyăngz manyh, yaz zef năngx phunz stiz pâyz timb, phunz Pha stăngz Yaz wax huungđ stăngz yămz stiz cah njaf, nzof Yaz yâuc yămz stiz cah njaf.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Coong wax đomc wac tuz, Zâu Yê-su songđ cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây quaix wax nganđ leepz Citc-lôn wăngx nof ninyh, yămz wa naih ah nomz lauf winb, Zâu Yê-su songđ cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nzac wa ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Wax zanyf, maic Nănh wax tauh Yu-đatc, lauf pâyz wax cuib tinc, wâyc Zâu Yê-su yađ cloon Nănh wax đomc stayb sây ninyh căpx dlonf yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Wâyc nây, Yu-đa, ênz ah peob peengz, cloon stayb munh paiđ taih wax đomc, cloon wax đomc Pha-li-si munh paiđ taih nyăngz munh, ninyh tauv wax cuyb tinc, yâuc nzauf toongz tâuf pa, cloon bopc zax tungh zăngc ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Wâyc Zâu Yê-su pâyz tuz Nănh cayx pongh nyăngz muif huungđ dlayc, Nănh songđ japc staox taih, naic stiz coong: “Nyâuh lov mănv heh?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Stiz tauz Nănh coong: “Yê-su, Na-sa-leetx munh.” Nănh coong ănz stiz: “Six yaz gôh.” (Wax zanyf, maic Nănh wax tauh, Yu-đa năngx jinh cloon nănh stiz stâuđ wa.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Wax zanyf, Zâu Yê-su ah yac coong ănz stiz: “Six yaz gôh,” stiz songđ toiv phunz đangz yâuc glinyf nzac nib ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zef naic stiz: “Nyâuh lov mănv heh?” Stiz songđ coong: “Yê-su, Na-sa-leetx munh.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Zâu Yê-su zef coong: “Yaz six bux nyâuh coong zâyf yaz gôh nâyx nzec. Six, năngđ coong nyâuh lov yaz, bix phunz nâyx đomc munh muf.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />(Nây six phunz setb taih toix nzuf Nănh coong quaix nyăngz wac coong: “Pha jaoz phunz Yaz wax đomc munh, Yaz max ayx stiz gaih lanh tiny.”) <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Wax zanyf, Si-môn Pi-tê naih ah zuungz nzuc đao, nănh songđ luutz nzuc setb taih, bopc stayb munh pyây nyăngz pâuz, yâuc pătb wax tauh pâuz byaoh wax phanx bah noomh setc. Wax tauh pâuz bux six hipđ ayx Man-zu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su coong ănz Pi-tê coong: “Oix zuc zaub nzuc ănz nzac nuih ninyh! Pha jaoz phunz yaz nyăngz zan, yaz bix max hoopđ zuc hopb naz?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Tăng wa, wax đomc peengz cloon wax tauh peengz pyây cloon Yu-tai munh paiđ taih wax đomc munh, songđ zoz Zâu Yê-su yâuc stayb Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Tah yetx, stiz ênz Nănh ninyh tauv An-natx wa, wâyc An-natx six Ca-ya-phatx nyăngz pha taz, wax nyăngv Ca-ya-phatx six ayx stayb munh pyây. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />(Nâyx tauh Ca-ya-phatx six cah đangc coong ănz Yu-tai munh coong, phunz ah lanh munh tayc tayv pec stingx six senz năngx gongx têx.)<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Wax zanyf, Si-môn Pi-tê cloon pitc tauh stayb sây ninyh lêpc Zâu Yê-su. Six wax tauh stayb sây cloon stayb munh pyây tinyh quênx, nănh songđ tuz cloon Zâu Yê-su nzac stayb munh pyây nyăngz pyau peengh cah njaf ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Six Pi-tê lauf stâuđ yămz wa jeengh cungh ngwaic, năngđ nâyx wax tauh stayb sây, six cloon stayb munh pyây tinyh quênx wax tauh, setb ninyh coong ănz jămđ jeengh wax tauh munh sab pâuz, songđ ênz Pi-tê nzac ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Tăng wa, jămđ jeengh wax tauh sab pâuz, coong ănz Pi-tê: “Mâyh max zâyz lauf wax tauh munh nyăngz stayb sây haz?” Pi-tê tauz: “Yaz max zâyf.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc pâuz cloon paiđ ninyh wax đomc munh stâuđ yămz wa, wâyc guungh song stiz songđ căpx ah đauc tâuf, yâuc poc wa siz tâuf. Pi-tê lauf cloon stiz stâuđ yămz wa siz tâuf.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Wax zanyf, stayb munh pyây naic Zâu Yê-su tauv Nănh wax đomc stayb sây cloon Nănh nzaox nyăngz jau. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh: “Yaz toongx songx coong phunz muif lanh nzuf. Yaz muif dlih yămz huyđ toongh cloon yămz bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau nzaox, six Yu-tai munh tinyh đoih căpx dlonf nyăngz tinc, yaz max pinyx coong toix laiv huungđ. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Săngh laix mâyh bix naic yaz? Phanv naic wax đomc munh numđ yaz coong ănz stiz đomc munh. Six, wax đomc munh pâyz tuz yaz coong huungđ.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Zâu Yê-su jinh đangh coong năngđ nâyx, songđ naih ah tauh paiđ ninyh wax đomc stâuđ wa beb Zâu Yê-su ah đitb, yâuc coong: “Mâyh tauz stayb munh pyây ayx năngđ nâyx naz?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Zâu Yê-su tauz nănh: “Năngđ coong yaz coong max toix, phanv nuz tauv max toix wax zâux wac geh. Six năngđ coong yaz coong toix, săngh laix mâyh bix bopc yaz?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Tăng wa, lauf năngx jinh zuc stayb wax zanyf, An-natx phunz ênz Nănh ninyh stayb munh pyây Ca-ya-phatx wa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Wax zanyf, Si-môn Pi-tê lauf năngx jinh stâuđ yămz wa siz tâuf. Tăng wa, munh coong ănz nănh: “Mâyh max zâyf lauf wax lanh munh nyăngz stayb sây haz?” Pi-tê songđ pyenv coong: “Max zâyf yaz.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Stayb munh pyây wax đomc pâuz naih ah lanh six cloon Pi-tê pătb bah noomh setc wax tauh tinyh jenb, coong: “Max zâyf yaz phătc mâyh cloon wax lanh munh yămz wa lauđ winb haz?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Six Pi-tê zef pyenv ah hâyđ timb, zayz songđ lênh dlih ayx caix.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Tăng wa, stiz ênz Zâu Yê-su tăng Ca-ya-phatx nyăngz pyau ninyh Lô-ma quanz pâu nyăngz tinc. (Wax zanyf, guungh năngx jinh njâub njâu, stiz max nzac Lô-ma quanz pâu nyăngz tinc cah njaf ninyh phunz stiz nzăngđ max zuc wâyx, năngđ nâyx stiz nzăngđ hayh nhlinc Pyenv Mengc Stêtz.) <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Năngđ nâyx, Phi-latx songđ setb ninyh pongh stiz yâuc coong: “Nyâuh zoz luungđ wac taih cooux nâyx lanh munh heh?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Stiz tauz ănz nănh coong: “Năngđ coong nâyx lanh munh max ayx luungđ huđ dlayc, buz six max jaoz nănh phunz quanz.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Wâyc năngđ nâyx, Phi-latx coong ănz stiz: “Nyâuh phanv ênz nâyx lanh munh muf bix âyz nyâuh nyăngz gâyf njanh stămđ nănh.” Yu-tai munh tauz Phi-latx coong: “Buz max naih gâyf tayx toix laiv lanh munh.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />(Năngđ nâyx six phunz setb taih toix nzuf Zâu Yê-su coong nyăngz wac, six cah đangc Nănh coong tauv Nănh cayx zuc tayc ayx năngđ laix.)<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Tăng wa Phi-latx zef nzac wa quanz pâu tinc cah njaf ninyh, yâuc êu ênz Zâu Yê-su taih Phi-latx songđ naic Nănh coong: “Mâyh zâyf Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh max?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Zâu Yê-su zef tauz: “Mâyh cănh coong ayx nâyx, max six naih mănv coong yaz nyăngz jau bux mâyh?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Phi-latx tauz: “Yaz max zâyf Yu-tai munh nhlenz? Cănh mâyh nyăngz munh cloon wax đomc stayb munh jaoz mâyh phunz yaz lec. Ha mâyh ayx laiv huungđ heh?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Yaz nyăngz côkz max săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz. Năngđ coong yaz nyăngz côkz săngh nây bamh canz nyăngz, yaz nyăngz pâuz six bopc zax max phunz yaz zuc jaoz phunz Yu-tai munh. Six Nâyx zanyf yaz nyăngz côkz max zâyf yămz nây.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Tăng wa Phi-latx coong naic Nănh: “Ha mâyh six ayx huungh yah?” Zâu Yê-su tauz: “Mâyh cănh coong yaz six huungh. Yaz tuz steengb taih six wâyc nâyx đomc, yaz nzac bamh canz taih six lauf wâyc nâyx đomc, six nongc ayx zanyx manyf phunz senz gâyf, Laiv lanh săngh senz gâyf nyăngz munh six mungv yaz nyăngz wac.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Phi-latx naic Nănh coong: “Senz gâyf six luungđ heh?” Coong nâyx zâux wac tuz, nănh zef setb ninyh pongh Yu-tai munh yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Yaz zah nănh max phătc naih luungđ stoif tiny. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Six, âyz nyâuh nyăngz gâyf tauv quaix Pyenv Mengc Stêtz yaz six pungx ah tauh stoif munh phunz nyâuh. Năngđ nâyx, nyâuh oix yaz pungx Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh phunz nyâuh max?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Tăng wa stiz zef hamv, coong: “Max zâyf pungx nâyx tauh, six pungx Ba-la-batc lêc.” Wax zanyf, Ba-la-batc six ah tauh ayx stac munh.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Năngđ nâyx, toongx wax zanyf, Phi-latx êu zoz Zâu Yê-su, yâuc êu bopc Nănh. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Wax đomc peengz nongc nzim saz ah nomz huungh tany. Stiz đongx ănz Nănh nyăngz pyây, yâuc zuz phunz Nănh ah byenđ guyz đao stiv lamh. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Nănh stiz taih tauv Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah đangc yâuc coong: “Paix Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh!” stiz zef beb Nănh nyăngz minb đuungx đitb. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Phi-latx zef setb taih ah hâyđ timb yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Phanv mangc, yaz ênz nâyx tauh munh setb taih phunz nyâuh, phunz nyâuh pâyz tuz coong yaz zah nănh max phătc naih luungđ stoif tiny.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Tăng wa Zâu Yê-su songđ setb taih, pyây đongx nongc nzim saz wax nomz huungh tany yâuc zuz guyz stiv lamh. Phi-latx coong ănz stiz: “Phanv mangc nâyx lanh munh geh!” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Wax zanyf, wax đomc stayb munh cloon paiđ ninyh wax đomc munh ah phătc Nănh, stiz songđ hamv coong: “Tingz nănh ănz săpc đăngc zax! Tingz nănh ănz săpc đăngc zax!” Phi-latx bux stiz: “Nyâuh phanv cănh zoz nănh tingz jămz geh, wâyc yaz zah nănh max phătc naih luungđ stoif tiny.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Yu-tai munh tauz nănh coong: “Buz naih gâyf, âyz wax cuyb gâyf, nănh six zuc tayc wâyc nănh cănh zanyb nănh ayx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Wâyc nây, tauv Phi-latx numđ nâyx zâux wac, nănh zef năngx cumh nzav têx timb, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />nănh zef nzac wa quanz pâu tinc cah njaf muf coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Mâyh tăng laiv tix taih heh?” Six Zâu Yê-su max tauz nănh. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Wâyc nây, Phi-latx naic Nănh coong: “Mâyh max tauz yaz haz? Mâyh max pâyz coong yaz naih lanyf pungx mâyh, yâuc naih lanyf tingz mâyh ănz săpc đăngc zax haz?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Zâu Yê-su zef tauz nănh coong: “Năngđ coong max zâyf tăng cah zâyc jaoz lanyf phunz mâyh, mâyh six max naih luungđ lanyf cun yaz tiny. Six wâyc năngđ nâyx, zoz yaz jaoz phunz mâyh wax tauh naih stoif năngx lub têx.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Wâyc nâyx zâux wac, Phi-latx lov jau pungx Zâu Yê-su, six Yu-tai munh hamv lub, coong: “Năngđ coong quanz pungx nănh quanz six max zâyf Sê-sa nyăngz lah pyeoz toic. Laiv lanh cănh zanyb nănh ayx huungh six cloon Sê-sa săngh yônz zaz.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Wâyc nây, Phi-latx numđ nâyx đomc wac, songđ phunz ênz Zâu Yê-su setb cungh ngwaic taih, nănh songđ stâyv nzac wa stămđ stoif nyăngz tăngx ninyh, wax cuyb tinc six hipđ ayx “Tipc Njăuz Tinc”; six Hipđ-lu nyăngz wac hipđ ayx “Căpc-ba-ta”. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />(Wax zanyf six bênc quaix Pyenv Mengc Stêtz nyăngz noib. Cox săpc nyâyc săngx huđ wax zanyf.) Phi-latx coong ănz Yu-tai munh: “Mangc geh, nyâuh nyăngz huungh!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Six stiz hamv lub coong: “Tayx nănh gôh! Tayx nănh gôh! Tingz jămz nănh ănz săpc đăngc zax!” Phi-latx naic stiz: “Yaz tingz jămz nyâuh nyăngz huungh naz?” Wax đomc stayb munh tauz: “Buz max naih huungh, blătc nzuf Sê-sa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Tăng wa, Phi-latx songđ jaoz Zâu Yê-su phunz stiz nongc ênz ninyh tingz ănz săpc đăngc zax, nzof nănh stiz songđ zoz Zâu Yê-su ênz ninyh.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Zâu Yê-su cănh zuc đamz săpc đăngc zax ninyh tauv wax cuyb tinc hipđ ayx “Pyây Mo Zoongz”, wax cuyb tinc Hipđ-lu nyăngz wac six hipđ ayx “Gô-gô-ta”. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Munh tingz jămz Nănh ănz wax cuyb tinc, cloon iz lanh munh timb, yămz nâyx leepz, cloon wax leepz, six Zâu Yê-su yămz mungh tongx. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Wax zanyf, Phi-latx lauf êu ja ah nomz bangz đăngc songđ điux ănz wa săpc đăngc zax. Wax đomc đăngc ja coong: YÊ-SU NA-SA-LEETX MUNH, YU-TAI MUNH NYĂNGZ HUUNGH. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Năngđ nâyx, naih Yu-tai munh đuungx toc wax đomc đăngc, wâyc Zâu Yê-su zuc tingz jămz nyăngz tinc stătx wa dlanyh. Wax đomc đăngc nongc Hipđ-lu wac, La-tiny wac, cloon Hi-lapc wac ja taih. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Wâyc nây, Yu-tai munh wax đomc stayb munh coong ănz Phi-latx: “Joođ năngx gâyf ja coong ‘Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh’, six phanv ja coong ‘Nănh coong “Yaz six Yu-tai munh nyăngz Huungh.”’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Phi-latx tauz: “Yaz ja nyăngz wac yaz bâyf ja nzof.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Tăng wa, wax đomc peengz tingz Zâu Yê-su ănz săpc đăngc zax wax zanyf, nănh stiz zoz Nănh nyăngz guyz taih tinyh tanb ayx pyâyz phănc — ah lanh peengz ah phănc — cloon guyz đao. Wax byenđ guyz six max taih tungh gonh, ah cuyb buyx lumh tăng cah zâyc đotc cah đi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Năngđ nâyx, stiz lanh coong ănz lanh: “Năngx gâyf zeb nâyx byenđ guyz, six nyupx tăm mangc jađ mănv tuz nănh.” Năngđ nây six phunz Canyx Stâub coong nyăngz wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf coong:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Stiz tinyh phunz yaz nyăngz guyz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">nyupx tăm nongc yaz nyăngz guyz.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Tăng wa, wax đomc peengz songđ ayx năngđ nâyx.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Wax zanyf, stâuđ yămz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz săpc đăngc zax cah sinh nyăngz munh, naih Nănh nyăngz nzif cloon nănh nyăngz nzif nyăngz ô stayx, six Cê-lô-batx nyăngz au Ma-li-ya, cloon Mak-đa-la nyăngz Ma-li-ya. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Zâu Yê-su mangc phătc Nănh nyăngz nzif cloon Nănh stăngz wax tauh stayb sây stâuđ wa cah sinh, Nănh songđ coong ănz Nănh nyăngz nzif coong: “Nzif lex, mangc nhlex, mâyh nyăngz toonz!” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Tăng wa Nănh zef coong ănz wax tauh stayb sây: “Mangc bex, nây six mâyh nyăngz nzif!” Tăng wax zanyf, wax tauh stayb sây songđ ênz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz nzif muf nănh nyăngz pyau.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Blătc wa, wâyc Zâu Yê-su pâyz tuz coong muif huungđ cumh pâuz tuz ayx soongb nzuf, six wâyc phunz Canyx Stâub nyăngz wac tuz setb taih toix nzuf, Zâu Yê-su songđ coong: “Yaz nyâuđ gatb.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Yămz wa naih ah nomz eengz ănz pong tiu stuib womz, wâyc nây, munh zoz zeengb stotb tipb ănz bah stab queeng đany yoomf tiu stuib womz taih, yăngf ănz Nănh nyăngz nzetx. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Năngđ nâyx, Zâu Yê-su đopx wax cuyb tiu stuib wax zanyf, Nănh songđ coong: “Muif huungđ ayx soongb nzuf nzof gôh!” Nănh nyăngz pyây songđ căpc têx, bix siv setc.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Wax zanyf, wâyc wax noib six toix bênc cumh pâuz noib, wâyc max phunz naih munh tayc nyăngz stayđ yămz wa săpc đăngc zax tauv tingc congz noib (wâyc tingc congz noib six nongc sen nzongf), Yu-tai munh songđ joođ Phi-latx bopc wax đomc munh staux jaz năngx nau, bix pungx nzac taih nongc nzâyz ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Wâyc nây, wax đomc peengz songđ ninyh bopc tah yetx tauh nyăngz staux nau, zef bopc tauv tah nyâyc tauh six cloon Zâu Yê-su zuc tingz jămz wax đomc munh. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Six ninyh tauv Zâu Yê-su wa, stiz phătc Nănh siv setc blătc, songđ max bopc Nănh nyăngz staux nau. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Six wax đomc peengz naih ah tauh, nongc wic nzopb Zâu Yê-su nyăngz lah tam, songđ lênh dlih naih stămđ cloon womz pletx setb taih. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Phătc nâyx đomc dlayc wax lanh munh songđ ayx zanyx manyf, nâyx lanh munh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac six senz nyăngz. Nănh pâyz coong nănh coong six senz nyăngz, phunz nyâuh lauf zen. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Wax đomc dlayc setb taih six wâyc ayx phunz canyx stâub nyăngz wac setb taih toix nzuf coong: “Nănh nyăngz stung max naih laiv stinz zuc nau.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Yămz pitc đoif Canyx Stâub zef coong: “Stiz six mangc staox stiz nzopb wax Tauh munh.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Wax đomc dlayc blătc nzuf, Yô-sepx six A-li-ma-tê munh, nănh six Zâu Yê-su nyăngz ah lanh stayb sây (pinyx ayx wâyc cumh nzav Yu-tai munh), nănh joođ Phi-latx nongc nzâyz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ ninyh. Phi-latx songđ nyenc. Tăng wa, nănh songđ taih nzâyz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Ni-cô-đê-matx — nănh six cah đangc njinh nzămc taih pongh Zâu Yê-su wax lanh munh — lauf taih, nzâyz stungz đangz cloon cah sangz njăngx văn loou tinyh zanb taih, cox ah pez Lô-ma nyăngz nzăngv sanz. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Tăng wa stiz nzâyz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ ninyh yâuc nongc đôc buyx cloon njaiz đangz sênh pêuz stayđ, âyz Yu-tai munh nyăngz gâyf bênc săngh nongc plopx. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Yămz Zâu Yê-su zuc tingz jămz wa naih ah nomz lauđ winb, yămz wa lauđ winb yâuc naih ah nomz stâu săngb, wax nomz stâu cah njaf max zeengx plopx mănv ănz. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Wâyc wax noib six Yu-tai munh bênc cumh pâuz nyăngz noib yâuc wâyc wax nomz stâu yămz stătx wa, stiz bix plopx Zâu Yê-su ănz wa.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Wax nomz gâyf paix nyăngz tah yetx noib bah đoomz tonx njâu, wax zanyf guungh lauf max zeengx gwăngz, Mak-đa-la wax tauh Ma-li-ya ninyh tauv wa stâu yâuc phătc wax nomz njăuz pyây stuyđ gâyh wa stâu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Wâyc nây, Ma-li-ya songđ tiuv muf pongh Si-môn Pi-tê cloon Zâu Yê-su stăngz wax tauh stayb sây, nănh songđ bux stiz coong: “Munh stuyđ Zâu gâyh wa stâu nzof, buz yâuc max pâyz tuz stiz ănz Nănh laiv tix.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Tăng wa Pi-tê cloon wax tauh stayb sây songđ setb cungh ngwaic ninyh yâuc ninyh wa stâu. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Nănh stiz iz lanh tiuv ninyh, six wax tauh stayb sây tiuv năngx căn têx Pi-tê, songđ ninyh tauv wa stâu đangc. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Nănh cah đong tex mangc, phătc wax đomc đôc buyx tăpx wa, six nănh max nzac cah njaf ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Si-môn Pi-tê, lêpc nănh đangz, ninyh tauv tinc, nănh nzac stâu cah njaf ninyh. Nănh phătc wax đomc đôc buyx tăpx ănz wa, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />six sênh pêuz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz pyây wax nomz tungh minb, max cloon wax đomc đôc buyx yămz ah cuyb tinc, six cănh lanyc glonc yămz ah đoif. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Wax zanyf, ninyh tauv wa stâu đangc wax tauh stayb sây, yâuc japc nzac ninyh, nănh mangc phătc songđ zen. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Wâyc stiz lauf max zeengx manyh pec Canyx Stâub nyăngz wac coong tauv Zâu Yê-su six zuc tăng tayc săngh taih. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Wa iz lanh stayb sây zef phunb đangz lauf stiz nyăngz pyau.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Six Ma-li-ya stâuđ yămz wa stâu cungh ngwaic haoh. Nzof nănh cun haoh, cun cah đong mangc nzac wa stâu cah njaf ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Nănh phătc iz lanh stinz munh zuz guyz phangb pec, jinh đangh stâyv yămz ănz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz stayđ wax tix tinc, ah lanh stâyv yămz pyây wax leepz, ah lanh stâyv yămz staux wax leepz. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Wa iz lanh stinz munh naic nănh: “Munh nzif lex, săngh laix mâyh bix haoh heh?” Nănh tauz stiz: “Wâyc munh stuyđ yaz nyăngz Zâu ninyh, yaz yâuc max pâyz stiz ănz Nănh laiv tix.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Coong wax đomc wac tuz, nănh winb đangz lauf songđ phătc Zâu Yê-su stâuđ wa, six nănh max saz coong wa six Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz Nănh: “Munh nzif lex, săngh laix mâyh bix haoh heh? Mâyh lov mănv heh?” Wâyc Ma-li-ya nyâyh coong Zâu Yê-su six ayx lauđ winb nyăngz munh, nănh songđ naic: “Munh tah lex, năngđ coong zâyf mâyh nzâyz Nănh ninyh, joođ bux phunz yaz pâyz mâyh ănz Nănh laiv tix, nzof yaz nzăngđ hayh ninyh ênz Nănh lauf.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Zâu Yê-su êu nănh coong: “Ma-li-ya lex.” Nănh winb lauf, songđ nongc Hipđ-lu wac tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Lap-bô-ni lex” (wax zâux wac âyz gâyf six coong: “Stayb pha lex”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz nănh: “Năngx gâyf lumz yaz, wâyc yaz max zeengx muf Tênb-toongh Pha wa; six oix zuc muf pongh yaz nyăngz yâuf pez bix bux stiz coong: ‘Yaz muf yaz nyăngz Pha wa, six lauf nyâuh nyăngz Pha, nzof yaz nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh six lauf nyâuh nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh.’” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mak-đa-la wax tauh Ma-li-ya songđ ninyh, lănv bux wax đomc stayb sây coong: “Yaz tuz phătc Zâu nzof,” yâuc lănv Zâu Yê-su coong bux Nănh wax đomc wac.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Tăng wa, lauf wax noib cayx nzămc, six gâyf paix nyăngz tah yetx noib, stayb sây buz yămz wax cuyb tinc muif tungđ jeengh omz nzuf, wâyc cumh nzav Yu-tai munh, Zâu Yê-su taih stâuđ yămz stiz nyăngz mungh tongx yâuc coong ănz stiz: “Peengh oonz phunz nyâuh bex.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Coong tuz, Nănh phunz iz saz puf cloon Nănh nyăngz lah tam phunz stiz mangc. Wax zanyf, wax đomc stayb sây tuz phătc Zâu senz numđ nyađ nzongf. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su zef coong ănz stiz: “Peengh oonz phunz nyâuh gôh. Pha paiđ yaz năngđ laix, yaz lauf paiđ nyâuh năngđ wa nâyx.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Coong tuz, Zâu Yê-su hab siv ănz stiz yâuc bux stiz coong: “Oix zuc stipx Zâu Singx-Lingh. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Năngđ coong nyâuh quanyf stoif phunz laiv tauh, wax tauh six tuz quanyf stoif; năngđ coong nyâuh max quanyf phunz laiv tauh, wax tauh nyăngz stoif six max tuz quanyf.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Wa săpc nyâyc lanh stayb sây naih ah lanh hipđ ayx Tô-matx, yâuc hipđ ayx Sây Toix, Zâu Yê-su taih wax zanyf nănh max cloon stiz yămz wa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Wâyc nâyx, wax đomc stayb sây coong ănz nănh: “Buz tuz phătc Zâu nzof.” Six nănh tauz stiz coong: “Năngđ coong yaz max phătc tingz jămz tinc yămz Nănh nyăngz puf, yâuc zob yaz nyăngz bah đoz ănz tingz jămz tinc, cloon yaz nyăngz puf max tuz lumz tauv nănh nyăngz lah tam, yaz six max zen.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Yetc noib cah đangz Zâu Yê-su wax đomc stayb sây zef yămz wa pyau njaf, Tô-matx lauf cloon stiz yămz wa. Wax đomc jeengh lauf omz sen nzuf, Zâu Yê-su taih stâuđ yămz wa mungh tongx yâuc coong: “Peengh oonz phunz nyâuh bex.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su bux Tô-matx coong: “Phanv tăpx mâyh nyăngz bah đoz ănz nây bix mangc yaz nyăngz puf pongđ. Yâuc phanv zoz mâyh nyăngz puf tăpx ănz yaz nyăngz lah tam geh. Năngx gâyf nyâuđ nhlengc, six oix zuc zen.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tô-matx zef tauz ănz Nănh coong: “Yaz nyăngz Zâu cloon yaz nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh lex.” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Zâu Yê-su bux nănh coong: “Wâyc mâyh phătc yaz, mâyh nzăngđ zen. Max zeengx phătc bix zen wax đomc munh senz naih oonz looc gôh.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Tăng wa, Zâu Yê-su lauf ayx đuungx huungđ jix caox njingc yămz Nănh wax đomc stayb sây nyăngz cah đangc, wax đomc cumh pâuz six max tuz ja ănz nâyx zây stâub; <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />six nâyx đomc dlayc tuz ja taih phunz nyâuh zen coong Zâu Yê-su six Zâu Jix-Tuz, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Toonz, yâuc phunz nyâuh zen caođ Nănh nyăngz manyh tuz naih săngh mengc.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Blătc wax đomc dlayc, Zâu Yê-su zef hinđ setb taih phunz stayb sây buz yămz wa Ti-bê-lêtx coiđ sinh. Nănh hinđ setb taih ayx năngđ nâyx: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />wax đomc stayb sây tinyh đoih căpx dlonf yămz wa naih — Si-môn Pi-tê, Tô-matx, yâuc hipđ ayx Sây Toix, Na-ta-na-ên, nănh six yămz Ca-na dlanyh Ga-li-lê stâyz phangz, cloon Sê-bê-đi wax đomc toonz, cloon Nănh iz lanh stayb sây timb. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Si-môn Pi-tê bux stiz coong: “Yaz cayx ninyh ayx byauf.” Stiz coong ănz nănh: “buz lauf căn mâyh ninyh.” Stiz setb ninyh nzac ah saz đangđ, six wax munf stiz ayx max tuz luungđ tiny. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Tauv guungh gwăngz, Zâu Yê-su stâuđ wa coiđ sinh, six, stayb sây buz max pâyz coong wa six Zâu Yê-su. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Wax zanyf Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Sây lex, nyâuh max naih luungđ byauf nongc nhlinc haz?” Stiz tauz Nănh coong: “Max.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Six Nănh bux stiz: “Phanv pungx leđ quaix byaoh wax phanx đangc sinh ninyh, nyâuh six tuz byauf.” Tăng wa, stiz pungx lec nzac songđ tuz byauf đuungx nzongf ayx tuz stiz max naih jab tăkc tuz leđ staox taih. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Tăng wa, naih ah lanh stayb sây, six Zâu Yê-su stăngz wax tauh, coong ănz Pi-tê: “Lâyc six Zâu.” Năngđ nâyx, tauv Si-môn Pi-tê numđ coong wa six Zâu, songđ zoz guyz đao taih sênh ănz stinb (wâyc nănh jinh đangh căng căng), songđ đanyz nzac womz ninyh. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Năngx naih wax đomc stayb sây six yămz wa đangc (wâyc stiz gâyh coiđ sinh max côz, cungb gâyh cox zu săpc meetx nâyx), tăkc lêpc ah phunb leđ byauf pong. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Tăng wa, stiz setb đangđ staox coiđ sinh taih wax zanyf, stiz phătc naih ah đauc tâuf tanv năngx jinh naih tâuf, naih byauf cloon nzu siz ănz wa cah zâyc. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Zâu Yê-su bux stiz: “Nzâyz tix cay nyâuh nzăngđ ah yac ayx tuz wax đomc byauf taih nây.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Si-môn Pi-tê songđ nzac đangc ninyh tăkc leđ quaix wa coiđ sinh taih, byauf lub pong leđ nzuf naih ah pez ngâuf săpc stamz tauh. Six hănđ tuz byauf đuungx nzongf, leđ lauf max byaif. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz stiz: “Taih nây nhlinc bah đoomz gôh.” Six, wax đomc stayb sây buz yâuc max naih mănv nzađ naic Nănh: “Mâyh six mănv heh?” Wâyc stiz tinyh đoih pâyz coong lâyc six Zâu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Zâu Yê-su njăpc staox taih, zoz nzu yăngf phunz stiz, hănđ byauf lauf ha. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Nây six Zâu Yê-su tăng tayc săngh taih, Nănh hinđ setb taih phunz stayb sây buz phătc, tah stamz hâyđ.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Tauv stiz nhlinc bah đoomz tuz, Zâu Yê-su coong bux Si-môn Pi-tê: “Yô-hanx nyăngz toonz, Si-môn lex, mâyh stăngz yaz năngx đuungx têx nâyx đomc munh max?” Nănh tauz Zâu Yê-su coong: “Zâu lex, stăngz lêc, mâyh pâyz coong yaz stăngz mâyh.” Zâu Yê-su coong bux nănh: “Oix zuc jămđ yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh jenz bex.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Zâu Yê-su zef coong ănz nănh tah nyâyc hâyđ: “Yô-hanx nyăngz toonz, Si-môn lex, mâyh senz stăngz yaz max?” Nănh tauz Zâu Yê-su: “Zâu lex, stăngz lêc, mâyh pâyz coong yaz stăngz mâyh.” Zâu Yê-su coong bux nănh: “Oix zuc jămđ yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh bex.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Zâu Yê-su zef naic nănh tah stamz hâyđ: “Yô-hanx nyăngz toonz, Si-môn lex, mâyh stăngz yaz max?” Pi-tê songđ numđ munz stimz wâyc Zâu Yê-su naic nănh tuz tah stamz hâyđ coong: “Mâyh stăngz yaz max?” Nănh tauz Zâu Yê-su: “Zâu lex, mâyh pâyz muif huungđ nzuf; mâyh pâyz coong yaz stăngz mâyh.” Zâu Yê-su coong ănz Nănh: “Oix zuc jămđ yaz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh bex. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Yaz coong senz bux mâyh, mâyh năngx gunx wax zanyf, mâyh cănh stayb quav langb oix ninyh laiv tix lauf ninyh, six tauv mâyh côx, mâyh six stuungb cănh nyăngz puf, phunz munh stayb quav langb phunz mâyh yâuc ênz mâyh ninyh, mâyh max oix ninyh nyăngz tinc.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Zâu Yê-su coong ayx nâyx, nongc nuz tauv nănh zuc tayc ayx laix phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh tuz gwăngz eeng. Coong wac tuz, Zâu Yê-su bux nănh: “Oix zuc lêpc yaz bex.” <verse eid="JHN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pi-tê winb đangz, phătc Zâu Yê-su stăngz wax tauh stayb sây lêpc nănh đangz, wax tauh munh six nhlinc bah nzămc năngv wax munf bix pongc Zâu Yê-su nyăngz cah lapc, yâuc naic coong: “Zâu lex, maic mâyh wax tauh six mănv heh?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Wâyc nây, mangc phătc wax lanh munh, Pi-tê songđ coong ănz Zâu Yê-su: “Zâu lex, ha nâyx lanh munh six ayx laix heh?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Zâu Yê-su coong ănz Nănh: “Năngđ coong yaz oix wax lanh munh yămz tuz tauv yaz taih, bix naih luungđ quenđ tauv mâyh heh? Mâyh phanv lêpc yaz gôh.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Wâyc nây, nâyx zâux wac lănv nzêux yămz wax đomc yâuf pez coong wax tauh stayb sây six max tayc. Six Zâu Yê-su max coong ănz nănh coong wax lanh munh six max tayc, six cungb coong: “Năngđ coong yaz oix wax lanh munh yămz tuz tauv yaz taih, bix naih luungđ quenđ tauv mâyh heh.”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Nâyx six wax tauh stayb sây ayx zanyx manyf tauv nâyx đomc jau, nănh yâuc ja nâyx đomc jau nyăngz munh, nzof pănh pâyz tuz coong nănh nyăngz zanyx manyf wac six senz nyăngz. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Zâu Yê-su ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz, năngx naih đuungx huungđ timb, năngđ coong stuy nzuf muif huungđ cumh pâuz ja têx, yaz nyâyh taih, yămz nây guungh đi, six max naih tinc ănz tuz tongf munh ja taih wax đomc stâub.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>